#: game/proto.msg:671
msgid "Sure."
msgstr "Visst."

#: dialog/abelaine.msg:602
msgid "Sorry, I don't have time for this. Bye."
msgstr "Ledsen, jag har inte tid med det här. Hej då."

#: dialog/abelaine.msg:603
msgid "Do I look like your personal delivery service? Do it yourself, you fat lazy bitch. Bye."
msgstr "Ser jag ut som din personliga leveransservice? Gör det själv, din feta, lata subba. Hej då."

#: dialog/abelaine.msg:604
msgid ""
"Thanks! Here's the part. The copying room is in the basement. Just use the stairs directly behind Brother Matthew\n"
" in the chapel area."
msgstr ""
"Tack! Här har du delen. Kopieringsrummet ligger i källaren. Använd bara trappan direkt bakom broder Matthew\n"
" i kapellområdet."

#: dialog/abelaine.msg:605
msgid "Not a problem. [You take the part.] I'll bring it down to Max right away."
msgstr "Inga problem. [Du tar delen.] Jag tar ner den till Max på en gång."

#: dialog/abelaine.msg:700 dialog/dcmom.msg:202 dialog/dctyler.msg:255
#: dialog/kcbob.msg:114 dialog/kcmaida.msg:212 dialog/ncbishop.msg:221
