#: dialog/vclynett.msg:825 dialog/vcskeeve.msg:124 dialog/vcstark.msg:405
#: dialog/wsterm2a.msg:135 dialog/zi8ball.msg:208
msgid "Yes."
msgstr "Ja."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:154
msgid ""
"Yes. But before I go, I would like to ask you some\n"
" questions."
msgstr ""
"Ja. Men innan jag går skulle jag vilja ställa\n"
" några frågor till dig."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:155
msgid ""
"Not just yet. I'm going to look around a little\n"
" bit more."
msgstr ""
"Inte riktigt än. Jag ska se mig omkring\n"
" lite mer."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:156
msgid "Well, may the gods watch over you."
msgstr "Må gudarna vaka över dig."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:157 dialog/acmynoc.msg:179 dialog/vcgreg.msg:222
msgid "Thank you, goodbye."
msgstr "Tack, hej då."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:158 dialog/ahmonk.msg:400 dialog/bcrebecc.msg:139
#: dialog/bczeke.msg:117 dialog/ccdoctor.msg:107 dialog/gclumpy.msg:240
#: dialog/ocariel.msg:127 dialog/ocdalia.msg:113
msgid "What do you want to know?"
msgstr "Vad vill du veta?"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:159
msgid ""
"What can you tell me of the men who trade with our\n"
" village?"
msgstr ""
"Vad kan du berätta om männen som handlar med våra\n"
" by?"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:160
msgid ""
"What can you tell me about this object I have from\n"
" a vault?"
msgstr ""
"Vad kan du berätta om det här föremålet jag har från\n"
" ett valv?"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:161 dialog/vccasidy.msg:182 dialog/vcskeeve.msg:246
msgid "Nothing, never mind."
msgstr "Inget, glöm det."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:162
msgid ""
"Very well, but don't waste too much time. Without the GECK,\n"
" we're doomed."
msgstr ""
"Nå väl, men slösa inte för mycket tid. Utan GECK,\n"
" är vi dödsdömda."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:163
msgid "I know, don't worry -- I've got it all under control."
msgstr "Jag vet, oroa dig inte -- Jag har allt under kontroll."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:164 dialog/dcstory2.msg:106 dialog/dcstory2.msg:157
#: dialog/ecarthur.msg:117 dialog/ecarthur.msg:119 dialog/ecarthur.msg:121
#: dialog/echermit.msg:104 dialog/fsface.msg:209 dialog/kcsulik.msg:151
#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:5741 dialog/ocjimmy.msg:152 dialog/ocmatt.msg:121
#: dialog/ocmatt.msg:124 dialog/ocmatt.msg:145 dialog/qhprzrch.msg:233
#: dialog/qhprzrch.msg:253 dialog/vcconnar.msg:109 dialog/vcskeeve.msg:136
#: dialog/vcstark.msg:315
msgid "Why?"
msgstr "Varför?"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:165
msgid "I must be going. Goodbye."
msgstr "Jag måste gå nu. Hej då."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:166
msgid ""
"The traders? They come from Klamath about every two months. There\n"
" won't be another here for a month or more, but Klamath's only a few days\n"
" east of here."
msgstr ""
"Handlarna? De kommer från Klamath ungefär varannan månad. De\n"
" kommer inte förrän om en månad eller mer, men Klamath ligger bara några dagar\n"
" österut härifrån."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:167 dialog/acvillgr.msg:160 dialog/acvillgr.msg:162
#: dialog/acvillgr.msg:166 dialog/acvillgr.msg:185 dialog/acwarior.msg:160
#: dialog/acwarior.msg:162 dialog/acwarior.msg:166 dialog/acwarior.msg:182
#: dialog/fclaocho.msg:461 dialog/fclaocho.msg:471 dialog/scelise.msg:240
msgid "Thank you. Goodbye."
msgstr "Tack. Hej då."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:168
msgid ""
"What can you tell me about this object I have from\n"
" the sacred vault?"
msgstr ""
"Vad kan du berätta om det här föremålet jag har från\n"
" det heliga valvet?"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:169
msgid ""
"Looks like a metal water gourd. Maybe the\n"
" vault sent it to us as an omen."
msgstr ""
"Ser ut som en vattenkalebass gjord av metall. Kanske\n"
" valvet skickade den till oss som ett omen."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:170
msgid "Can you tell me who brought this item to our village?"
msgstr "Kan du berätta vem som tog med sig det här föremålet till vår by?"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:171
msgid "Thank you. I must be going. Goodbye."
msgstr "Tack så mycket. Jag måste gå nu. Adjö."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:172
msgid "I hope you do."
msgstr "Jag hoppas att du gör det."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:173
msgid "Your overconfidence makes all of us suffer! Goodbye!"
msgstr "Ditt överdrivna självförtroende får oss alla att lida! Adjö!"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:175
msgid ""
"Why? Look around you -- our village dies. The gardens wither and\n"
" every day children and old ones collapse. You must bring Eden to us before\n"
" it is too late!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:176
msgid "And I will take care of it. Goodbye."
msgstr "Och jag ska ta hand om det. Adjö."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:177
msgid ""
"I am the Chosen One -- I \"must\" do only as I\n"
" please. Goodbye."
msgstr ""
"Jag är den Utvalde - jag \"måste \" bara göra som jag\n"
" behagar. Adjö."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:178
msgid ""
"I don't remember his name, just that he was old and loud -- too\n"
" loud for proper manners -- but he knew many things. He was from Klamath, east\n"
" like I said."
msgstr ""
"Jag minns inte hans namn, bara att han var gammal och högljudd - för\n"
" högljudd för att uppföra sig ordentligt - men han visste många saker. Han var från Klamath, österut\n"
" som jag sa."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:180
msgid ""
"Are you still here? You must go find the GECK. Staying here\n"
" doesn't help us."
msgstr ""
"Är du kvar här? Du måste gå och hitta GECK. Att stanna här\n"
" hjälper oss inte."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:181
msgid ""
"This bridge is all you need to worry about,\n"
" friend. I can take care of myself."
msgstr ""
"Den här bron är allt du behöver bry dig om,\n"
" min vän. Jag kan ta hand om mig själv."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:182
msgid "I was just heading out. Goodbye, my friend."
msgstr "Jag var på väg ut. Adjö, min vän."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:183
msgid "I will speak to you no longer, insubordinate pig!"
msgstr "Jag tänker inte tala med dig längre, ditt olydiga svin!"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:184
msgid "I would like to ask you another question."
msgstr "Jag skulle vilja fråga dig något annat."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:185
msgid "That was quick! Have you found the holy Vault 13?"
msgstr "Det var snabbt! Har du hittat det heliga Valv 13?"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:187 dialog/acnagor.msg:116 dialog/ccquincy.msg:148
#: dialog/ccquincy.msg:150 dialog/epac10.msg:1112 dialog/epac11.msg:392
#: dialog/epac12.msg:464 dialog/epac2.msg:393 dialog/fcchemst.msg:159
#: dialog/fcdokgrd.msg:282 dialog/fcdrwong.msg:163 dialog/fcfmatt.msg:179
#: dialog/mcjohnny.msg:170 dialog/mcjonny.msg:170 dialog/ncbigjes.msg:553
#: dialog/tribec2.msg:171
msgid "No, not yet."
msgstr "Nej, inte än."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:188
msgid ""
"You have? Wonderful! Did you bring back the\n"
" GECK?"
msgstr ""
"Har du? Underbart! Tog du med dig GECK:en\n"
" tillbaka?"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:189 dialog/ahelder.msg:217 dialog/cck9.msg:112
#: dialog/cck9.msg:140 dialog/ccmaster.msg:114 dialog/ccmaster.msg:149
#: dialog/ccxarn.msg:163 dialog/dcanna.msg:175 dialog/dcbilly.msg:164
