#: dialog/fctnkbar.msg:112 dialog/fctnkbar.msg:118 dialog/fctnkbar.msg:124
#: dialog/fctnkgmr.msg:113 dialog/fctnkgmr.msg:118 dialog/fctnkgmr.msg:123
#: dialog/fctnkmer.msg:112 dialog/fctnkmer.msg:118 dialog/fctnkmer.msg:124
#: dialog/fsempter.msg:161 dialog/fsempter.msg:166 dialog/fsface.msg:102
#: dialog/fsface.msg:131 dialog/fsface.msg:136 dialog/fsface.msg:141
