#: dialog/scmerk.msg:136 dialog/scmerk.msg:237 dialog/scmerk.msg:247
#: dialog/scmira.msg:119 dialog/scmira.msg:122 dialog/scmira.msg:175
#: dialog/scmira.msg:178 dialog/scsalbob.msg:113 dialog/scsalbob.msg:137
#: dialog/scsalbob.msg:148 dialog/scvortis.msg:126 dialog/scvortis.msg:143
#: dialog/scvortis.msg:165 dialog/scwesgrd.msg:138 dialog/scwestin.msg:158
#: dialog/shtandi.msg:282 dialog/vclynett.msg:826 dialog/wsterm2a.msg:136
msgid "No."
msgstr "Nej."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:190
msgid "No. I haven't spoken to the people of the vault yet."
msgstr "Nej, jag har inte pratat med folket i valvet än."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:191
msgid "I don't believe that's any business of yours, my friend."
msgstr "Jag tror inte att du har med det att göra, min vän."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:192
msgid ""
"No? Chosen One, three old ones have died since you left. You must\n"
" not waste any more time."
msgstr ""
"Inte? Utvalde, tre gamla har dött sedan du lämnade oss. Du får\n"
" inte slösa mer tid."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:193
msgid "I'll find it, don't worry."
msgstr "Jag ska hitta den, oroa er inte."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:194 dialog/acmynoc.msg:197
msgid "I'm getting sick of your constant nagging."
msgstr "Jag börjar bli trött på ditt ständiga tjat."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:195
msgid "Well, why are you talking to me? Talk to them, and get the GECK."
msgstr "Varför pratar du med mig? Prata med dem, och hämta GECK:en."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:196
msgid "I will -- all in good time, my friend."
msgstr "Det ska jag göra -- allt i sinom tid, min vän."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:198
msgid "What news of the GECK, Chosen One?"
msgstr "Vad nytt om GECK:en, Utvalde?"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:199
msgid "I have found the vault!"
msgstr "Jag har hittat valvet!"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:200
msgid "I have not been able to find Vault 13."
msgstr "Jag har inte lyckats hitta Valv 13."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:201
msgid "Well, look, it's the Chosen One."
msgstr "Ser man på, det är ju Den Utvalde."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:203 dialog/scwestin.msg:122
msgid "Shut up."
msgstr "Håll tyst."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:204 dialog/dcrebecc.msg:357
msgid "Can I ask you a question?"
msgstr "Får jag ställa en fråga?"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:205
msgid "No, I've no time for you."
msgstr "Nej, jag har inte tid med dig."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:206
msgid "Whatever. Good bye."
msgstr "Visst. Adjö."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:207
msgid "Oh well. See you around."
msgstr "Nåväl. Vi ses."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:208
msgid "Go die."
msgstr "Gå och dö."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:209
msgid ""
"Greetings, dull one! See bridge? You cross, you be careful.\n"
" Bridge dangerous. You not want to fall. Okay?"
msgstr ""
"Var hälsad, ers tröghet! Se bro? Du korsa, du var försiktig.\n"
" Bro farlig. Du inte vill falla. Okej?"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:210
msgid "Umm... Hunh?"
msgstr "Ehh... Hunh?"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:211
msgid "Wretch! You have failed the village!"
msgstr "Din usling! Du har svikit byn!"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:212
msgid "You betray us. For that you'll die!"
msgstr "Du förråder oss. För det kommer du att dö!"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:213 dialog/acvillgr.msg:180
msgid "You are a traitor to your own people."
msgstr "Du är en förrädare mot ditt eget folk."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:214 dialog/acvillgr.msg:181 dialog/acwarior.msg:178
msgid "Why do you do this?"
msgstr "Varför gör du så här?"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:215
msgid "The Elder was wrong. You are evil."
msgstr "Den Äldste hade fel. Du är ond."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:300
msgid ""
"My father taught me how to make stronger blades than most. Get me a piece\n"
" of flint and I'll fix your spear, too. You'll need it in the wilderness."
msgstr ""
"Min far lärde mig att göra starkare blad än de flesta. Ge mig en bit\n"
" flinta så lagar jag ditt spjut också. Du kommer att behöva det i vildmarken."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:301
msgid "Where would I get some of this flint?"
msgstr "Var skulle jag få tag på den här flintstenen?"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:302
msgid ""
"They say your Aunt Morlis has been hoarding a piece. She's so\n"
" ill-tempered I don't think anyone's asked her. Of course, the witch will want\n"
" something in return."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:303 dialog/dcdealer.msg:106 dialog/gcfestus.msg:452
#: dialog/gchank.msg:181 dialog/gchank.msg:201 dialog/kcardin.msg:192
#: dialog/vcdrtroy.msg:147 dialog/vcmsmith.msg:115 dialog/vcmsmith.msg:138
#: dialog/vcstark.msg:159 dialog/vcstark.msg:202 dialog/vcsupgrd.msg:145
#: dialog/vcwalace.msg:331
msgid "Thanks. Goodbye."
msgstr "Tack. Hej då."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:304
msgid "Did you talk your aunt out of her flint?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:305
msgid "Yes, I have some right here."
msgstr "Ja, jag har lite här."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:306 dialog/dclara.msg:393 dialog/fcoz7.msg:184
#: dialog/fcoz7.msg:193 dialog/hctyphon.msg:203 dialog/ncorvill.msg:537
#: dialog/ncsalvat.msg:388 dialog/tribec1.msg:376 dialog/vcstark.msg:406
msgid "Not yet."
msgstr "Inte än."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:307
msgid "It's a good piece. Give me your spear."
msgstr "Det är en bra bit. Ge mig ditt spjut."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:309
msgid "I guess I don't have one."
msgstr "Jag antar att jag inte har någon."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:310
msgid "Now, you put the pieces like so..."
msgstr "Nu sätter du ihop delarna så här..."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:311
msgid ""
"The Chosen One without a spear? Well, you'll have to take one of\n"
" mine. Now, let's get to work..."
msgstr ""
"Den Utvalde utan spjut? Tja, du får ta ett av\n"
" mina. Låt oss nu sätta igång..."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:312
msgid "Here is your new spear."
msgstr "Här är ditt nya spjut."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:313
msgid "Thank you, my friend -- this will help a lot."
msgstr "Tack, min vän -- det här kommer att hjälpa mycket."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:314
msgid ""
"Yes, but I was wondering about your spear. It looks a little\n"
" different."
msgstr ""
"Ja, men jag undrade över ditt spjut. Det ser lite\n"
" annorlunda ut."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:400
msgid "Welcome home, Chosen One! Did you find the vault? Have you returned with the GECK?"
msgstr "Välkommen hem, Utvalde! Hittade du valvet? Har du återvänt med GECK?"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:401
msgid "Me not find yet."
msgstr "Jag inte hitta än."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:402
msgid "No, I haven't found it yet."
msgstr "Nej, jag har inte hittat det än."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:403
msgid "I'm not in the mood for your questions. Goodbye."
msgstr "Jag är inte på humör för dina frågor. Adjö."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:404
msgid ""
"Things are not going well, Chosen One. The drought is getting worse and our crops are\n"
" sure to fail. We are trying to salvage what we can to build up our food reserves."
msgstr ""
"Det går inte så bra, Utvalde. Torkan blir värre och våra grödor kommer\n"
" säkert på att vissna. Vi försöker rädda vad vi kan för att bygga upp våra matreserver."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:405
msgid "Why no trade with other villages?"
msgstr "Varför inte byta andra byar?"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:406
msgid "Me doing best me can. Me find GECK. Me return."
msgstr "Jag göra gott jag kan. Jag hitta GECK. Jag återvända."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:407
msgid "Why can't we trade with other villages for the food we need? "
msgstr "Varför kan vi inte handla med andra byar för att få den mat vi behöver? "

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:408
msgid "I'm doing my best. When I find the GECK I'll return with it."
msgstr "Jag gör mitt bästa. När jag hittar GECK kommer jag tillbaka med det."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:409
msgid ""
"We are a simple people and have little to offer in trade. The few towns that we have\n"
" contacted while you were away have shown no interest in helping us."
msgstr ""
"Vi är ett enkelt folk och har inte mycket att erbjuda i handeln. De få städer som vi har\n"
" kontaktat medan du var borta har inte visat något intresse för att hjälpa oss."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:410 dialog/ocdalia.msg:132 dialog/ocjimmy.msg:169
#: dialog/shtandi.msg:214
msgid "Me see."
msgstr "Jag fatta."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:411 dialog/actemvil.msg:125 dialog/actemvil.msg:172
#: dialog/bcrebecc.msg:155 dialog/bcrebecc.msg:174 dialog/bczeke.msg:130
#: dialog/cccook.msg:150 dialog/ccdoctor.msg:137 dialog/ccdoctor.msg:182
#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:269 dialog/dcsmitty.msg:491 dialog/ocariel.msg:143
#: dialog/ocgoris.msg:140 dialog/ocgoris.msg:167 dialog/ocgrutha.msg:117
#: dialog/ocjoseph.msg:138 dialog/ockerith.msg:118 dialog/ockerith.msg:142
#: dialog/ocmatt.msg:125 dialog/ocsandy.msg:129 dialog/octhearn.msg:130
#: dialog/ocvaldis.msg:124 dialog/scbuster.msg:126 dialog/scbuster.msg:129
#: dialog/scbuster.msg:132 dialog/scbuster.msg:135 dialog/scbuster.msg:138
#: dialog/scbuster.msg:141 dialog/shtandi.msg:219
msgid "I see."
msgstr "Jag förstår."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:412
msgid "You are our only hope, Chosen One. Please do not fail us!"
msgstr "Du är vårt enda hopp, Utvalde. Snälla, svik oss inte!"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:413
msgid "It is good to see you, Chosen One. How fares your quest?"
msgstr "Det är trevligt att se dig, Utvalde. Hur går det med ditt uppdrag?"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:414 dialog/ccxarn.msg:172
msgid "Me still look."
msgstr "Jag fortfarande leta."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:415 dialog/ccxarn.msg:174
msgid "I'm still looking."
msgstr "Jag letar fortfarande."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:416
msgid "I don't want to talk about it."
msgstr "Jag vill inte prata om det."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:417
msgid ""
"You must hurry. Things are getting worse here at home. Soon there will be little food and\n"
" the Elder speaks of rationing what we have. I fear for the future of Arroyo."
msgstr ""
"Du måste skynda. Saker och ting blir värre här hemma. Snart kommer det att finnas lite mat och\n"
" den Äldste talar om att ransonera det vi har. Jag fruktar för Arroyos framtid."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:418
msgid ""
"Chosen One! Please tell me that you have completed your quest. Our village is dying, and so\n"
" are our people. "
msgstr ""
"Utvalde! Snälla, säg att du har slutfört ditt uppdrag. Vår by håller på att dö, och så\n"
" gör vårt folk."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:419
msgid "No, me still look."
msgstr "Nej, jag fortfarande leta."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:420 dialog/ocgrutha.msg:178
msgid "No, I'm still looking."
msgstr "Nej, jag letar fortfarande."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:421
msgid "How are things?"
msgstr "Hur är det?"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:422
msgid ""
"I am sorry, Chosen One, but I am beginning to question my faith in you. The very lives of\n"
" our people are in your hands. Please find the holy Thirteen and return to us with the GECK!"
msgstr ""
"Jag är ledsen, Utvalde, men jag börjar tvivla på mitt förtroende för dig. Självaste livet för\n"
" vårt folk ligger i dina händer. Snälla, hitta det heliga Tretton och återvänd till oss med GECK!"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:423
msgid ""
"Our crops fail, the brahmin die, everyone goes hungry now. The cries of the children at night\n"
" allow no one any sleep. We are becoming a desperate people."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:424
msgid "Me continue look."
msgstr "Jag fortsätta titta."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:425
msgid "I'll do what I can."
msgstr "Jag ska göra vad jag kan."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:426
msgid "Once again you return to us, Chosen One. Not empty-handed, I hope?"
msgstr "Ännu en gång återvänder du till oss, Utvalde. Inte tomhänt, hoppas jag?"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:427
msgid "Me sorry, no find GECK yet."
msgstr "Jag ledsen, jag inte hitta GECK än."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:428
msgid "I'm sorry, I still haven't found the GECK."
msgstr "Jag är ledsen, men jag har fortfarande inte hittat GECK."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:429
msgid "I've had enough of this."
msgstr "Jag har fått nog av det här."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:430
msgid ""
"People are dying here while you stroll about the lands. Perhaps you should be searching\n"
" elsewhere instead of returning here."
msgstr ""
"Folk dör här medan du strosar runt i landet. Du kanske borde söka\n"
" någon annanstans istället för att återvända hit."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:500 dialog/qcgenprs.msg:121
msgid "Have you talked to the Elder yet?"
msgstr "Har du pratat med den Äldste än?"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:600
msgid "Any final advice for me before I head out into the unknown?"
msgstr "Har du något sista råd till mig innan jag ger mig ut i det okända?"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:601
msgid "Certainly. Beware the weapons of the Outsiders. The gecko's bite is nothing compared to the destructive power of their boom-sticks."
msgstr ""
"Absolut. Se upp för Utomståendes vapen. Geckons bett är ingenting jämfört "
"med den förödande kraften i deras dunderpinnar."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:602
msgid "Got it. Anything else?"
msgstr "Okej. Något mer?"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:603
msgid "Do not give your trust freely. Honor means very little out in the wastes. Stay alert and always question the motives of others."
msgstr ""
"Ge inte bort ditt förtroende så lättvindigt. Ära betyder inte mycket ute i "
"ödemarken. Var på din vakt och ifrågasätt alltid andras motiv."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:604
msgid "Sure thing. Is that all?"
msgstr "Visst. Var det allt?"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:605
msgid ""
"Never forget your roots. The world outside our village is full of shiny toys and luxuries that might make our life here in Arroyo appear simple and plain.\n"
" But remember that the lifestyle of the Outsiders produces wicked men ruled by greed and corruption. Be wary not to become like He-Who-Must-Not-Be-Named."
msgstr ""
"Glöm aldrig dina rötter. Världen utanför vår by är full av glänsande "
"leksaker och lyx som kan få vårt liv här i Arroyo att verka enkelt och "
"anspråkslöst.\n"
" Men kom ihåg att livet bland de utomstående skapar onda människor som styrs "
"av girighet och korruption. Se till att du inte blir som Han-Som-Inte-Får-"
"Nämnas."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:606
msgid "I'll never forget my roots. Thanks for the advice, Mynoc."
msgstr "Jag kommer aldrig att glömma mina rötter. Tack för rådet, Mynoc."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:607
msgid "He-Who-Must-Not-Be-Named? Uh... who?"
msgstr "Han-som-inte-får-nämnas-vid-namn? Eh... vem då?"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:608
msgid "Are you so drunk with the glory of being the Chosen One that you've forgotten about... [Mynoc quickly glances around to be sure no one is listening in, then leans forward and lowers his voice to a whisper.] ... Kaga?"
msgstr ""
"Är du så berusad av äran att vara den Utvalde att du har glömt bort... ["
"Mynoc ser sig snabbt omkring för att försäkra sig om att ingen lyssnar, "
"lutar sig sedan framåt och sänker rösten till en viskning.] ... Kaga?"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:609
msgid "Oh! Yeah, that guy. I'll make sure I don't end up like him. Thanks."
msgstr ""
"Åh! Ja, den där killen. Jag ska se till att jag inte hamnar i samma "
"situation som han. Tack."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:610
msgid "Oh, that's who I thought you meant. But, uh, why don't you go ahead and tell me what his deal is again. I really love that story."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:611
msgid "[Mynoc mumbles something under his breath and shakes his head before beginning his tale.] As you should know, he was once the greatest warrior of our tribe. He led many expeditions into the outside world, and it was there where corruption began to poison his mind."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:612
msgid "He became infatuated with the ways of the Outsiders, where power could bring anyone great respect and luxury. He began to view himself as superior to his fellow tribesmen who were content to live a more simple life."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:613
msgid "What a jerk."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:615
msgid "When our tribe fell into these hard times, he deemed himself our people's savior and entered the Temple of Trials to prove himself to be the Chosen One."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:617
msgid "Nevermind, I don't want to hear this story anymore. Bye."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:618
msgid "He made his way through the Temple, quickly reaching the final test: a hand-to-hand battle with a fellow warrior."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:620
msgid "Wait, he blew up that door and everything? Do we have it rebuilt every time someone goes through the temple? Speaking of that, who built the temple in the first place?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:621
msgid "I don't have time to answer all your silly questions. Do you want me to finish the tale, or not?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:622
msgid "Sorry. Please continue."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:623
msgid "Actually, I think I'm ready to go. See you around."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:624
msgid "During the final trial, He-Who-Must-Not-Be-Named unsheathed a hidden blade and used it to kill his opponent. When the Elder confronted him about his dishonorable use of a hidden weapon, he argued that it was not cheating, but rather proved him to be a cunning warrior."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:625
msgid "The Elder did not agree. He-Who-Must-Not-Be-Named was forcibly exiled from our tribe and his name was never to be spoken amongst us again. As he was cast away into the wastes, he swore an oath of vengeance. Vengeance against our tribe, and especially against you."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:626
msgid "Me? What'd I do?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:627
msgid "Thanks for the story, but I'd best be on my way now."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:628
msgid "You are the Chosen One, a title he feels is rightfully his. His pride will not allow you to live."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:629
msgid "I'm not going to worry about it. He's probably dead out in the wastes by now, anyway."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:630
msgid "I'll be on my guard. Hopefully he's dead out in the wastes by now."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:631
msgid "Listen, and understand. He-Who-Must-Not-Be-Named is out there. He can't be bargained with. He can't be reasoned with. He won't feel pity, or remorse, or fear. And he absolutely will not stop, ever, until you are dead."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:632
msgid "You know, I think you might be overdoing it with the melodrama, just a tad. Anyway, thanks for the advice. I'll see you around, Mynoc."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:633
msgid "I'll keep that in mind. Take care, Mynoc."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:640
msgid "Could you tell me anything about this Kaga guy?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:641
msgid ""
"[His eyes go wide and he looks around nervously as if expecting to suddenly be struck by lightning.] Have you lost your senses out in the wastes?! You should know better than to speak the name of the outcast! He is to be referred to only as He-Who-Must-Not-Be-Named.\n"
" Our village suffers enough without inviting the wrath of the Gods upon us. [He raises his eyes nervously to the sky.]"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:642
msgid "Sorry about that, Mynoc. But would you mind telling me what Ka... I mean, \"He-Who's\" deal is again? I really love that story."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:643
msgid "You know, I'd forgotten how stupidly superstitious you people could be. I'll see you around."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:650
msgid "I've faced him before, so I'm sure I can handle him if our paths cross again."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:651
msgid "Actually, he's already dead. I left his corpse out there to rot in the wastes."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:660
msgid "[Mynoc nods grimly.] He may have strayed from the path, but he was once a great and respected warrior. I hope his troubled soul has found peace in the next world."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:661
msgid "Indeed. I'll see you around, Mynoc."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:662
msgid "Whatever. He seemed like an asshole to me. I'll see you around, Mynoc."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:1000 dialog/acvillgr.msg:1000 dialog/acwarior.msg:1000
#: dialog/kchild.msg:1000 dialog/kcitizen.msg:1000 game/pro_crit.msg:1300
msgid "Elder"
msgstr "Äldste"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:1001 dialog/acvillgr.msg:1001 dialog/acwarior.msg:1001
#: dialog/kchild.msg:1001 dialog/kcitizen.msg:1001
msgid "Founder"
msgstr "Grundare"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:1002 dialog/acvillgr.msg:1002 dialog/acwarior.msg:1002
#: dialog/kchild.msg:1002 dialog/kcitizen.msg:1002
msgid "Vault Dweller"
msgstr "Valvinvånare"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:1003 dialog/acvillgr.msg:1003 dialog/acwarior.msg:1003
#: dialog/eccvnmst.msg:200 dialog/kchild.msg:1003 dialog/kcitizen.msg:1003
#: game/map.msg:103 game/map.msg:104 game/map.msg:105 game/map.msg:1500
#: game/map.msg:1522
msgid "Arroyo"
msgstr "Arroyo"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:1004 dialog/acvillgr.msg:1004 dialog/acwarior.msg:1004
#: dialog/eccvnmst.msg:208 dialog/kchild.msg:1004 dialog/kcitizen.msg:1004
#: game/map.msg:109 game/map.msg:110 game/map.msg:111 game/map.msg:112
#: game/map.msg:113 game/map.msg:114 game/map.msg:1502
msgid "Klamath"
msgstr "Klamath"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:1005 dialog/acvillgr.msg:1005 dialog/acwarior.msg:1005
#: dialog/kchild.msg:1005 dialog/kcitizen.msg:1005 game/worldmap.msg:243
msgid "Vault"
msgstr "Valv"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:1006 dialog/acvillgr.msg:1006 dialog/acwarior.msg:1006
#: dialog/kchild.msg:1006 dialog/kcitizen.msg:1006 dialog/newr1.msg:406
msgid "Chosen One"
msgstr "Den Utvalde"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:1007 dialog/acvillgr.msg:1007 dialog/acwarior.msg:1007
#: dialog/kchild.msg:1007 dialog/kcitizen.msg:1007 game/pro_crit.msg:48500
#: game/scrname.msg:1447
msgid "Shaman"
msgstr "Shaman"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:1008 dialog/acvillgr.msg:1008 dialog/acwarior.msg:1008
#: dialog/kchild.msg:1008 dialog/kcitizen.msg:1008 game/pro_crit.msg:1400
#: game/scrname.msg:112
msgid "Hakunin"
msgstr "Hakunin"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:1009 dialog/acvillgr.msg:1009 dialog/acwarior.msg:1009
#: dialog/kchild.msg:1009 dialog/kcitizen.msg:1009 game/pro_item.msg:27300
msgid "Healing Powder"
msgstr "Helande pulver"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:1010 dialog/acvillgr.msg:1010 dialog/acwarior.msg:1010
#: dialog/kchild.msg:1010 dialog/kcitizen.msg:1010 game/map.msg:215
#: game/map.msg:1536 game/worldmap.msg:200 game/worldmap.msg:550
msgid "Bridge"
msgstr "Bro"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:1011 dialog/acvillgr.msg:1011 dialog/acwarior.msg:1011
#: dialog/kchild.msg:1011 dialog/kcitizen.msg:1011 game/pro_crit.msg:1500
#: game/scrname.msg:110
msgid "Mynoc"
msgstr "Mynoc"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:1100 dialog/acvillgr.msg:1100 dialog/acwarior.msg:1100
#: dialog/kchild.msg:1100 dialog/kcitizen.msg:1100
msgid "The Elder is your mother and our leader."
msgstr "Den Äldste är din mamma och vår ledare."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:1101 dialog/acvillgr.msg:1101 dialog/acwarior.msg:1101
#: dialog/kchild.msg:1101 dialog/kcitizen.msg:1101
msgid "Our great ancestor who gave us knowledge."
msgstr "Vår store förfader som gav oss kunskap."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:1102 dialog/acvillgr.msg:1102 dialog/acwarior.msg:1102
#: dialog/kchild.msg:1102 dialog/kcitizen.msg:1102
msgid "The first to fight and win over chaos."
msgstr "Den förste att kämpa och vinna över kaos."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:1103 dialog/acvillgr.msg:1103 dialog/acwarior.msg:1103
#: dialog/kchild.msg:1103 dialog/kcitizen.msg:1103
msgid "That would be our beautiful village."
msgstr "Det skulle vara vår vackra by."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:1104 dialog/acvillgr.msg:1104 dialog/acwarior.msg:1104
msgid "That's a trading outpost a few days east of here."
msgstr "Det är en handelsutpost några dagar österut."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:1105 dialog/acvillgr.msg:1105 dialog/acwarior.msg:1105
#: dialog/kchild.msg:1105 dialog/kcitizen.msg:1105
msgid "The Vault is heaven."
msgstr "Valvet är himmelriket."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:1106 dialog/acvillgr.msg:1106 dialog/acwarior.msg:1106
#: dialog/kchild.msg:1106 dialog/kcitizen.msg:1106
msgid "You are the Chosen One."
msgstr "Du är den Utvalde."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:1107
msgid ""
"He heals us with his herbs and magic. He is in the\n"
" northern part of our village."
msgstr ""
"Han läker oss med sina örter och sin magi. Han är i den\n"
" norra delen av vår by."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:1108
msgid ""
"He heals us with his herbs and magic. He is in the\n"
" north part of our village."
msgstr ""
"Han läker oss med sina örter och sin magi. Han är i den\n"
" norra delen av vår by."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:1109
msgid ""
"It is a magic powder which will heal you, but will\n"
" make you sleepy."
msgstr ""
"Det är ett magiskt pulver som kommer att läka dig, men kommer\n"
" gör dig sömnig."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:1110 dialog/acvillgr.msg:1110 dialog/acwarior.msg:1110
#: dialog/kchild.msg:1110 dialog/kcitizen.msg:1110
msgid "The Great Bridge exits our village in the south."
msgstr "Den stora bron leder ut ur vår by i söder."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:1111
msgid "That would be me."
msgstr "Det skulle vara jag."

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:100
msgid "You see your young cousin, Nagor. You don't see his dog, Smoke, anywhere."
msgstr "Du ser din unga kusin, Nagor. Du ser inte hans hund, Smoke, någonstans."

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:101
msgid "You've known Nagor since he was an infant, and have always helped him when you could."
msgstr "Du har känt Nagor sedan han var ett spädbarn och har alltid hjälpt honom när du har kunnat."

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:102
msgid "Cousin, am I glad to see you! I need your help."
msgstr "Kusin, vad jag är glad att se dig! Jag behöver din hjälp."

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:103
msgid "Sorry, but I don't have the time."
msgstr "Ledsen, men jag har inte tid."

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:104
msgid "What do you need help with?"
msgstr "Vad behöver du hjälp med?"

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:105
msgid "Then I'll go out in the wilds myself!"
msgstr "Då ger jag mig ut i vildmarken själv!"

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:106
msgid "Hold on there... what was it you need help with?"
msgstr "Vänta lite... vad var det du behövde hjälp med?"

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:107 dialog/acnagor.msg:122
msgid "You do that."
msgstr "Gör det du."

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:108
msgid ""
"Smoke ran off into the hunting grounds and hasn't come back and now Morlis\n"
" won't let me go find him. She says it's too dangerous and he's just a dog, but I was\n"
" going to go anyway. But now you're here and you could do it and I wouldn't get in\n"
" trouble."
msgstr ""
"Smoke sprang iväg till jaktmarkerna och har inte kommit tillbaka och nu vägrar Morlis\n"
" låta mig leta efter honom. Hon säger att det är för farligt och att han bara är en hund, men jag tänkte\n"
" göra det i alla fall. Men nu är du här och du kan göra det och jag skulle inte hamna i\n"
" trubbel."

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:109
msgid "Sure. But where are the hunting grounds?"
msgstr "Visst. Men var är jaktmarkerna?"

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:110
msgid "Sure. I'll find him right now."
msgstr "Visst. Jag ska leta efter honom nu."

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:111
msgid "Forget it, I don't have time for this."
msgstr "Glöm det, jag har inte tid med det här."

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:112
msgid ""
"What'd you do, get hit in the head with a rock? They're on the far side of\n"
" Hakunin's tent, north of the village."
msgstr ""
"Vad gjorde du, fick du en sten i huvudet? De är på andra sidan av\n"
" Hakunins tält, norr om byn."

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:113
msgid "I'll be back with him soon."
msgstr "Jag kommer snart tillbaka med honom."

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:114 dialog/acnagor.msg:117
msgid "Have you found Smoke yet?"
msgstr "Har du hittat Smoke än?"

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:115
msgid "No, not yet. Where did you say the hunting grounds were?"
msgstr "Nej, inte än. Var sa du att jaktmarkerna fanns?"

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:118
msgid "No, not yet. I'll be back soon, though."
msgstr "Nej, inte än. Men jag kommer tillbaka snart."

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:119 dialog/tribec12.msg:123
msgid "I am sorry, but he is dead."
msgstr "Jag är ledsen, men han är död."

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:120
msgid ""
"You're just saying that 'cause you don't wanna look! I don't care what\n"
" Morlis says, I'm going to find him."
msgstr ""
"Det säger du bara för att du inte vill leta! Jag bryr mig inte om vad\n"
" Morlis säger, jag ska hitta honom."

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:121
msgid ""
"Nagor, what if something happens to you? Morlis would be alone and that would\n"
" make her real sad. You don't want to make her sad, do you?"
msgstr ""
"Nagor, tänk om något händer dig? Morlis skulle vara ensam och det skulle\n"
" göra henne riktigt ledsen. Du vill väl inte göra henne ledsen, eller hur?"

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:123
msgid "Well... no, I don't want to do that. Okay, I won't go, but it's not fair!"
msgstr "Nej, det vill jag inte göra. Okej, jag kommer inte att gå, men det är inte rättvist!"

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:124
msgid "Smoke will be okay. Goodbye."
msgstr "Smoke kommer att klara sig. Hej då."

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:125
msgid "You found Smoke! Thanks! Smoke, you're a bad dog!"
msgstr "Du hittade Smoke! Tack! Smoke, du är en stygg hund!"

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:126
msgid "You're welcome. Goodbye."
msgstr "Varsågod. Hej då."

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:127
msgid "Thanks again. I hope you have a really fun trip!"
msgstr "Tack åter igen. Jag hoppas att du får en riktigt rolig resa!"

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:128
msgid "I miss Smoke. Why couldn't you save him? You're the Chosen One."
msgstr "Jag saknar Smoke. Varför kunde du inte rädda honom? Du är den Utvalde."

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:129
msgid "I'm busy, dumb one. Go play someplace else."
msgstr "Jag är upptagen, dumskalle. Gå och lek någon annanstans."

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:130 dialog/echermit.msg:127 dialog/mcjo.msg:175
#: dialog/mckarl.msg:229
msgid "I go."
msgstr "Jag går."

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:131
msgid "I'm going after Smoke."
msgstr "Jag letar efter Smoke."

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:200
msgid ""
"Hello cousin... uh, I mean Chosen One. I hope you've found the GECK. I've heard a lot of\n"
" talk about hard times to come."
msgstr ""
"Hej kusin... eh, jag menar Utvalde. Jag hoppas att du har hittat GECK. Jag 'har hört en hel del\n"
" prat om kommande svåra tider."

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:202
msgid "Me still look, Nagor."
msgstr "Jag fortfarande letar, Nagor."

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:203
msgid "I'm still looking, cousin."
msgstr "Jag letar fortfarande, kusin."

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:204
msgid ""
"Welcome home, cousin. Things are getting a little tight around here. Have you found the holy\n"
" Thirteen and the GECK?"
msgstr ""
"Välkommen hem, kusin. Det börjar bli lite tufft här. Har du hittat det heliga\n"
" Tretton och GECK?"

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:206
msgid "Me not find. Sorry."
msgstr "Jag inte hitta. Ledsen."

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:207
msgid "I'm sorry, Nagor. I'm still looking."
msgstr "Jag är ledsen, Nagor. Jag letar fortfarande."

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:208
msgid ""
"Hello again, cousin. I guess you've noticed that things are really falling apart here. Please\n"
" find the GECK. We are in desperate need!"
msgstr ""
"Hej igen, kusin. Jag antar att du har märkt att saker och ting verkligen faller samman här. Snälla\n"
" hitta GECK. Vi är i desperat behov!"

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:210
msgid "Hi, cousin."
msgstr "Hej, kusin."

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:212
msgid "You not sound like usual self."
msgstr "Du inte låta som vanligt."

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:213
msgid "You don't sound like your usual self."
msgstr "Du låter inte som ditt vanliga jag."

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:214
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, cousin. Things have been getting worse and worse since you last left. People are\n"
" sick, the brahmin are dying and... I... my dog Smoke died - Morlis cooked him. I miss him so much. Sorry, but I can't\n"
" really talk any more..."
msgstr ""
"Jag är ledsen, kusin. Saker och ting har blivit värre och värre sedan du senast var här. Folk är\n"
" sjuka, brahminerna är döende och... jag... min hund Smoke dog - Morlis lagade mat av honom. Jag saknar honom så mycket. Ledsen, men jag kan inte\n"
" riktigt prata längre..."

#: dialog/acnagor.msg:215
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, cousin. Things have been getting worse and worse since you last left. People are sick,\n"
" the brahmin are dying and... I... my dog Smoke died. I miss him so much. Sorry, but I can't really\n"
" talk any more..."
msgstr ""
"Jag är ledsen, kusin. Saker och ting har blivit värre och värre sedan du senast var här. Folk är sjuka,\n"
" brahminerna är döende och... jag... min hund Smoke dog. Jag saknar honom så mycket. Ledsen, men jag kan inte\n"
" riktigt prata längre..."

