msgid "You see a guard wearing power armor of an unusual design. There is an insignia on the breastplate that you are unfamiliar with."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:103
msgctxt "gate1"
msgid "Halt! This is federal property -- no admittance without proper authorization."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:104
msgid "Uh... fed ur al?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:105
msgid "Me got pass... where I put?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:106
msgid "Me new. Me told you expect."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:107
msgid "Oh. Sorry, me go."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:108
msgid "I have my pass... it was right here."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:109
msgid "I'm a new recruit. I was told you'd be expecting me."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:110
msgid "Oh, sorry. I'll be heading out then."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:111
msgctxt "gate2"
msgid "You're a little slow, aren'tcha?? Well, just keep moving and don't come back here. You'll be fine. Understand?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:112
msgid "Me want go inside."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:113 dialog/ccgguard.msg:116 dialog/octhearn.msg:123
#: dialog/shtandi.msg:140
msgid "Ok. Me go."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:114
msgctxt "gate3"
msgid "Nobody gets... Damn. (slowly) Need pass get inside. You no got pass. You go away. You no go away, you get hurt. Understand?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:115
msgid "How bout me hurt you instead?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:117
msgctxt "gate14"
msgid "(places hand on weapon) Don't give me any excuses! You need to either show me your pass or give me the password!"
msgstr "(lägger handen på vapnet) Ge mig inga ursäkter! Du måste antingen visa mig ditt passerkort eller ge mig lösenordet!"

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:118
msgid "No can find pass, no remember password!"
msgstr "Kan inte hitta passet, kan inte komma ihåg lösenord!"

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:119
msgid "Screw this. Me kill."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:120
msgid "I'm sorry, I lost my pass and I don't know anything about a password."
msgstr "Jag är ledsen, men jag har tappat bort mitt passerkort och jag vet inget om ett lösenord."

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:121 dialog/ocgrutha.msg:220
msgid "Screw you and everyone who looks like you!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:122
msgctxt "gate5"
msgid "I suggest you leave this installation immediately and do not return here without proper authorization. Do I make myself clear?"
msgstr "Jag föreslår att du lämnar den här installationen omedelbart och inte återvänder hit utan korrekt tillstånd. Är jag tydlig nog?"

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:124
msgctxt "gate6a"
msgid "I see. May I have your password?"
msgstr "Jag förstår. Kan jag få ditt lösenord?"

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:125
msgctxt "gate6b"
msgid "I see. (places hand on weapon) All new recruits are to report for duty alone. I suggest you leave this installation immediately and do not return here with your entourage. Do I make myself clear?"
msgstr "Jag förstår. (lägger handen på vapnet) Alla nya rekryter ska anmäla sig till tjänstgöring ensamma. Jag föreslår att du lämnar denna installation omedelbart och inte återvänder hit med ditt följe. Är jag tydlig nog?"

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:126 dialog/ccgguard.msg:133
msgid "Sheepshead."
msgstr "Fårskalle."

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:128
msgctxt "gate7a"
msgid "One moment. (pause) Okay, you check out. Report to the drill chief. Go through the gate, past the kennel, and it's the first door on the right."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:129
msgctxt "gate7b"
msgid "(mumbles) Damn jarheads are getting dumber by the hour."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:131
msgctxt "gate8a"
msgid "Halt! -- Oh. I see you've returned and you're alone this time. All right, recruit, what's the password?"
msgstr "Halt! -- Åh. Jag ser att du har återvänt och att du är ensam den här gången. Okej, rekryten, vad är lösenordet?"

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:132
msgctxt "gate8b"
msgid "Halt! -- You again. I see you've still got your group with you. (places hand on weapon) I suggest you leave this installation immediately and do not return here. Do I make myself clear?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:135
msgctxt "gate9"
msgid "Halt! -- Back again, huh? You'd better have your pass or know your password this time. Well, I'm waiting?"
msgstr "Halt! -- Tillbaka igen, va? Det är bäst att du har ditt passerkort eller kan ditt lösenord den här gången. Nå, jag väntar?"

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:136
msgid "Uh... me not know. Me come back."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:137
msgid "Screw this. Me walk in over you dead body."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:138
msgid "Look, I lost my pass..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:139
msgid "Oh to hell with it. Bite the bullet, asshole!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:140
msgctxt "gate10"
msgid "This is your final warning. I suggest you leave this installation immediately and do not return here. Do I make myself clear?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:141
msgid "Ok, me go again..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:142
msgid "In words of ancients... Fuck you!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:144
msgid "In the words of the ancients... Fuck you!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:145
msgctxt "gate11a"
msgid "Halt! -- You again? You were warned. Alarm! Intruder at the gate! "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:146 dialog/ecprsgng.msg:108 dialog/hcsteve.msg:302
#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1100 game/combatai.msg:1103 game/combatai.msg:41675
msgid "Damn!"
msgstr "Förbannat!"

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:147
msgid "Intruder at the gate!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:148
msgid "Main entrance under attack!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:149
msgid "To the gate! Intruder at the gate!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:200 dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:200
msgid "...asshole..."
msgstr "...rövhål..."

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:201 dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:201
msgid "...yeah, you'd BETTER walk away..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:202 dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:202
msgid "...what a brownie hound..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:203 dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:203
msgid "...yes, sir! fuckin' sir!..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgguard.msg:300
msgid "Move along soldier."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdca.msg:101 dialog/ccmedgrd.msg:101
msgid "You see a guard in combat armor."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdca.msg:102
msgid "You see someone wearing combat armor. There is an insignia on the breastplate that you are unfamiliar with."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdca.msg:103 dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:103 dialog/ccmedgrd.msg:103
msgid "Nothing to report."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdca.msg:104 dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:104 dialog/ccmedgrd.msg:104
msgid "Nothing going on with me, how 'bout you?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdca.msg:105 dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:105 dialog/ccmedgrd.msg:105
msgid "Shouldn't you be at your post, soldier? It's not good to wander about here."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdca.msg:107 dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:107 dialog/ccmedgrd.msg:107
msgid "You better report to the Sarge and get suited up."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:106 dialog/cckevin.msg:300 dialog/ccmedgrd.msg:106
msgid "You're out of uniform."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:300
msgid "Hold on there. What do you think you're doing with that aircraft? There are no scheduled flights for several days."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:301
msgid "Nrg?"
msgstr "Va?"

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:302
msgid "I am aware of this."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:303
msgid "I'm sorry. I was just looking. I'll be going now."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:304
msgid "There's been a change of plans. I'm taking this aircraft."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:310
msgid "What? Oh, I see. Look, don't touch. Okay? Touch again and you die."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:311
msgid "(Smile then attack.)"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:312 dialog/ncmormen.msg:496
msgid "(Walk away.)"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:315
msgid "Oh shit, looks like we got ourselves an intruder. Code Red! I repeat, code Red!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:316
msgid "That sounds like a good idea. Touch the aircraft again and I'll put a bullet in your head."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:320
msgid "Right. And therefore you are..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:321
msgid "About to leave. Sorry to bother you."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:322
msgid "About to deliver an important message to the main base."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:323
msgid "Oh, really? And what does this message say."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:324
msgid "It's super top secret. I cannot tell you."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:325
msgid ""
"I'll tell you, but it's absolutely essential that you don't disclose this information to anyone else, for fear of a\n"
" mass panic. You see, it's come to my attention that one of the recent shipments of slaves is infected with an unknown, and\n"
" highly deadly, virus strain. I *must* get to the base immediately, or all our lives could be lost. Now stop wasting my time,\n"
" as there isn't a moment to spare."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:326
msgid "Yeah, I believe you. Looks like we got ourselves an intruder..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:327
msgid "Damnit! Ah, whatever. I never get told shit around here. Fine. Be on your way."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:328
msgid "Woah, that sounds bad. You better get moving then, I don't want this shit on my hands. Oh, and don't worry, I won't tell anyone."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:400
msgid ""
"[After a half hour of sitting in the dark cargo hold, you feel the craft touch down to earth once more. A moment\n"
" later, the cargo door opens and you see a squad of power armored soldiers. One of them does a double take at you then\n"
" turns to the others.] Holy shit! One of those mutie wastlanders stowed away in the 'bird! ALERT! We got an intruder!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:401
msgid ""
"[After a half hour of sitting in the dark cargo hold, you feel the craft touch down to earth once more. A moment\n"
" later, the cargo door opens and you see a squad of power armored soldiers. One of them does a double take at you then\n"
" turns to the others.] Holy shit! Some of those mutie wastlanders stowed away in the 'bird! ALERT! We got intruders!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:402
msgid "[Jump out and see how many you can take down before they waste you.]"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:403
msgid "[Raise hands in surrender and hope for the best.]"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:410
msgid ""
"Aw, it doesn't look like the mutie's gonna put up a fight. Maybe we should bring him to the Commander -- see\n"
" what he wants to do about this."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:411
msgid ""
"Aw, it doesn't look like the mutie's gonna put up a fight. Maybe we should bring her to the Commander -- see\n"
" what he wants to do about this."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:412
msgid ""
"Aw, it doesn't look like the muties are gonna put up a fight. Maybe we should bring them to the Commander -- see\n"
" what he wants to do about this."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:420
msgid ""
"[After a half hour of sitting in the dark cargo hold, you feel the craft touch down to earth once more. A moment\n"
" later, the cargo door opens and you see a squad of Enclave soldiers. One of them does a double-take at you.] What the hell\n"
" are you doing back here? You weren't authorized to be on that mission. What's your name, soldier?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:421
msgid "It doesn't matter what my name is, 'cause I'm not here to talk. [Jump out and start fighting.]"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:422
msgid ""
"Me? Oh, I'm, uh, *cough*mumble*cough*. Don't mind me, though. In fact, I should probably be going now.\n"
" [Get out and attempt to walk away nonchalantly.]"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:423 dialog/epac10.msg:423 dialog/epac10.msg:823
#: dialog/kcaldo.msg:202 dialog/kcbob.msg:151 dialog/vcnancy.msg:153
msgid "My name's "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:424
msgid ". Where am I?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:425
msgid ""
"No, what's *your* name, soldier? I was put here to test you and I gotta say you FAILED. If I were a wasteland\n"
" suicide assassin you and your whole crew would be dead right now! That is unacceptable! Shape up, soldier!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:426
msgid "Uh . . . my name "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:427
msgid ". I take fun ride in metal birdie! Go again! Wanna go again!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:428
msgid "You not need know my name. I no like you. I kill. [Jump out and start fighting.]"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:430
msgid "What are you, drunk? You're at Navarro, of course. If you're having memory problems, soldier, you might wanna go get yourself checked out. Maybe some of that radiation out there got to you."
msgstr "Vad är du, full? Du är vid Navarro, så klart. Om du har problem med minnet, soldat, borde du nog gå och bli undersökt. Lite av strålningen där ute har kanske påverkat dig."

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:440
msgid "Don't give me that bullshit. You're one of the new recruits, aren't you? Heh. That smart mouth of yours is gonna land you in all sorts of trouble--and I can't wait to see it happen. Now get back to your post, soldier."
msgstr "Kom inte med det där skitsnacket. Du är en av de nya rekryterna, eller hur? Heh. Din rappa käft kommer att ge dig alla möjliga problem, och jag kan inte vänta på att få se det hända. Gå nu tillbaka till din post, soldat."

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:450
msgid "Sir! Yes sir!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:451
msgid "Ma'am! Yes ma'am!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:460
msgid "[The soldier looks at one of his comrades.] My God, contact with all the muties and radiation out there must have made him retarded. You see? *That's* why I never volunteer for those wasteland runs. Anyway, let's put this stupid bastard out of his misery before he contaminates us."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccgrdpa.msg:461
msgid "[The soldier looks at one of his comrades.] My God, contact with all the muties and radiation out there must have made her retarded. You see? *That's* why I never volunteer for those wasteland runs. Anyway, let's put this stupid bitch out of her misery before she contaminates us."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccguard.msg:100
msgid "You see bright, shiny tin man."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccguard.msg:101
msgid "A soldier in power armor."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccguard.msg:102
msgid "A soldier in some new type of power armor, you'd guess."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccguard.msg:103
msgid "Can you believe it? I got KP duty again!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccguard.msg:104
msgid "Word is the old man's gonna issue leave to SF!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccguard.msg:105
msgid "To hell with waiting. I say we nuke all these primitives and get things over with."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccguard.msg:106
msgid "Got a light? Oh wait, never mind. Got one."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccguard.msg:107
msgid "Craps game behind the hanger tonight. Don't let the CO know."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccguard.msg:108
msgid "Who the--? <zzzt> We got an intruder here!"
msgstr "Vem i--? <zzzt> Vi har en inkräktare här!"

#: dialog/ccguard.msg:109
msgid "You there! Halt!"
msgstr "Du där! Stanna!"

#: dialog/ccguard.msg:110
msgid "Intruder on base!"
msgstr "Inkräktare på basen!"

#: dialog/ccguard.msg:111
msgid "Wait you--oh, never mind. "
msgstr "Vänta du--åh, glöm det. "

#: dialog/ccguard.msg:112
msgid "Look, better get your id. These false alarms got everybody jumpy."
msgstr "Bäst att du hämtar din legitimation. De här falska larmen gör alla nervösa."

#: dialog/ccguard.msg:113
msgid "You're supposed to be here, right? Damn these false alarm's get on my nerves!"
msgstr "Du ska vara här, eller hur? De här falska larmen går mig på nerverna!"

#: dialog/ccguard.msg:114
msgid "Intruder's over here! Get 'em!"
msgstr "Inkräktaren är här borta! Ta 'em!"

#: dialog/ccguard.msg:115
msgid "There's the intruder!"
msgstr "Där är inkräktaren!"

#: dialog/ccguard.msg:116
msgid "Over here! Don't let 'em get away!"
msgstr "Här borta! Låt 'em inte komma undan!"

#: dialog/ccguard.msg:117
msgid "We got an attack on the front. Send backup!"
msgstr "Vi blir attackerade på framsidan. Skicka förstärkning!"

#: dialog/ccguard.msg:118
msgid "Don't let the intruder get to the gate!"
msgstr "Låt inte inkräktaren komma fram till grinden!"

#: dialog/ccguard.msg:119
msgid "Die, primitive!"
msgstr "Dö, din primitiva jävel!"

#: dialog/cck9.msg:100
msgid "You see a cyberdog."
msgstr "Du ser en cyberhund."

#: dialog/cck9.msg:101
msgid "You see K-9."
msgstr "Du ser K-9."

#: dialog/cck9.msg:102
msgid "You see a cyberdog. It is part machine and part dog."
msgstr "Du ser en cyberhund. Den är delvis maskin och delvis hund."

#: dialog/cck9.msg:103 dialog/cck9.msg:118
msgid "The life functions of my master have terminated. Are you my new master?"
msgstr "Min herres livsfunktioner har upphört. Är du min nya mästare?"

#: dialog/cck9.msg:104 dialog/cck9.msg:119
msgid "Uh... doggie talk?"
msgstr "Eh... vovve prata?"

#: dialog/cck9.msg:105 dialog/cck9.msg:127
msgid "Okay. Me like doggie."
msgstr "Okej. Jag gilla vovve."

#: dialog/cck9.msg:106
msgid "No. Not want doggie."
msgstr "Nej. Jag inte vill ha vovve."

#: dialog/cck9.msg:107
msgid "Ha! A talking dog."
msgstr "Ha! En talande hund."

#: dialog/cck9.msg:108
msgid ""
"One; I am a dog. Two; I am communicating with you vocally using the common\n"
" English language. Therefore it is safe to assume that the answer to your question\n"
" is 'yes, doggie talk.' Now, do you intend to answer the question that I posed to\n"
" you a moment ago?"
msgstr ""
"Ett; jag är en hund. Två; Jag kommunicerar med dig vokalt med hjälp av det vanliga\n"
" svenska språket. Därför är det säkert att anta att svaret på din fråga\n"
" är 'ja, vovve prata.' Nu, tänker du svara på den fråga som jag ställde till\n"
" dig för en stund sedan?"

#: dialog/cck9.msg:109
msgid ""
"One; I am a dog. Two; I am communicating with you vocally using the common\n"
" English language. Therefore it is safe to assume that I am a talking dog. Now, do\n"
" you intend to answer the question that I posed to you a moment ago?"
msgstr ""
"Ett; jag är en hund. Två; Jag kommunicerar med dig vokalt med hjälp av det vanliga\n"
" svenska språket. Därför är det säkert att anta att jag är en talande hund. Nu,\n"
" tänker du svara på frågan som jag ställde till dig för en stund sedan?"

#: dialog/cck9.msg:110
msgid "Sorry, me forget question."
msgstr "Förlåt, glömde fråga."

#: dialog/cck9.msg:113
msgid "(sigh) Pay attention. Concentrate. Look me in the eyes. Now, are you ready?"
msgstr "(suck) Var uppmärksam. Koncentrera dig. Titta mig i ögonen. Är du redo nu?"

#: dialog/cck9.msg:114
msgid "Ready what?"
msgstr "Redo för vad?"

#: dialog/cck9.msg:115 dialog/ccxarn.msg:156
msgid "Yes. Me ready."
msgstr "Ja. Jag redo."

#: dialog/cck9.msg:116
msgid ""
"I... If it were not for the fact that your IQ is less than my height in\n"
" feet I would think that you are trying to irritate me. Now, be silent. Pay\n"
" attention. Concentrate. Look me in the eyes. I am about to ask you a question."
msgstr ""
"O... Om det inte vore för det faktum att din IQ är mindre än min längd i\n"
" fot skulle jag tro att du försöker irritera mig. Var tyst nu. Var\n"
" uppmärksam. Koncentrera dig. Titta mig i ögonen. Jag ska nu ställa en fråga till dig."

#: dialog/cck9.msg:117
msgid "So go ahead. Who stopping you?"
msgstr "Så fortsätt. Vem hindrar dig?"

#: dialog/cck9.msg:120
msgid "Yes. Me want doggie."
msgstr "Ja. Jag vill ha vovve."

#: dialog/cck9.msg:121 dialog/cck9.msg:123 dialog/cck9.msg:142
#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:174 dialog/fcdrfung.msg:160 dialog/generic.msg:205
#: dialog/hcdoc.msg:161 dialog/hcsteve.msg:158 dialog/nc3monte.msg:289
#: dialog/nccorbro.msg:746 dialog/scenlone.msg:181 dialog/shtandi.msg:222
#: dialog/vcskeeve.msg:188 dialog/ziblkjck.msg:105
msgid "No thanks."
msgstr "Nej tack."

#: dialog/cck9.msg:122 dialog/ccncomp.msg:139 dialog/dctyler.msg:502
#: dialog/scduppo.msg:116
msgid "Sounds good."
msgstr "Låter bra."

#: dialog/cck9.msg:124
msgid ""
"I... I refuse to go through this with you a second time! Were I\n"
" capable of full motivation I would bite you in the fleshy part of your\n"
" anterior region commonly referred to as the..."
msgstr ""
"Jag... Jag vägrar att gå igenom det här med dig en gång till! Vore jag\n"
" kapabel till fullständig motivation skulle jag bita dig i den köttiga delen av din\n"
" främre regionen som vanligtvis kallas för..."

#: dialog/cck9.msg:125
msgid "Ass. Me know what ass is. Me not dummy. Me just joke with you."
msgstr "Röv. Jag vet vad röv är. Jag inte dummis. Bara skämta med dig."

#: dialog/cck9.msg:126
msgid "Oh, a joke. Hardy har har har. Now, are you my new master or not?"
msgstr "Åh, ett skämt. Ha hi ho he hå. Nu, är du min nya mästare eller inte?"

#: dialog/cck9.msg:128
msgid "No. No want doggie."
msgstr "Nej. Jag inte vill ha vovve."

#: dialog/cck9.msg:129
msgid ""
"Excellent. I am in need of repairs, master. My motivation unit has\n"
" been removed. Find it, replace it, and I will join you."
msgstr ""
"Utmärkt. Jag är i behov av reparationer, mästare. Min motivationsenhet har\n"
" blivit borttagen. Hitta den, ersätt den, så kommer jag att följa med dig."

#: dialog/cck9.msg:130
msgid "Uh... Where I find?"
msgstr "Eh... Var jag hittar?"

#: dialog/cck9.msg:131
msgid "Any ideas on where I can find this part?"
msgstr "Några idéer om var jag kan hitta den här delen?"

#: dialog/cck9.msg:132
msgid ""
"I am not sure, master. I would try maintenance. It is upstairs in the\n"
" northeast corner of the base."
msgstr ""
"Jag är inte säker, mästare. Jag skulle försöka med underhåll. Det är på övervåningen i\n"
" nordöstra hörnet av basen."

#: dialog/cck9.msg:133 dialog/ocjul.msg:104
msgid "Okay. Me go."
msgstr "Okej. Ja' gå."

#: dialog/cck9.msg:134
msgid "I'll try there. If I don't find it, I'll look around for it."
msgstr "Jag ska försöka där. Om jag inte hittar den, letar jag runt efter den."

#: dialog/cck9.msg:135
msgid "Then leave me in peace."
msgstr "Lämna mig då i fred."

#: dialog/cck9.msg:137 dialog/fcchip.msg:164 dialog/fckenlee.msg:162
msgid "You got it."
msgstr "Ska ske."

#: dialog/cck9.msg:138
msgid ""
"Hello again. The life functions of my master have terminated. Are\n"
" you my new master?"
msgstr ""
"Hej igen. Min mästares livsfunktioner har avslutats. Är\n"
" du min nya mästare?"

#: dialog/cck9.msg:143
msgid "You are not my master. I cannot speak to you. Good bye."
msgstr "Du är inte min mästare. Jag kan inte tala med dig. Adjö."

#: dialog/cck9.msg:145
msgid "Hello master. Have you found my motivation unit?"
msgstr "Hej, mästare. Har du hittat min motivationsenhet?"

#: dialog/cck9.msg:146
msgid "No, me look more."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/cck9.msg:147
msgid "Yes. Me find."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/cck9.msg:148
