#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:101
msgid "You see the Navarro base Commander."
msgstr "Du ser befälhavaren för Navarro-basen."

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:103 dialog/ccqmstr.msg:103
msgid "Who the hell are you guys... Alert! Intruders on the base!"
msgstr "Vilka fan är ni... Varning! Inkräktare på basen!"

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:104
msgid "I don't have time to chitchat with the grunts. You're dismissed."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:105 dialog/ccmandr.msg:125
msgid "Time to die."
msgstr "Dags att dö."

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:107
msgid "I told you I don't have time for you. Leave this office and do not come back here unless I send for you. Dismissed!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:108
msgid "Disobeying a direct order of a superior officer is treason. I don't have time to court martial you so I'll handle this myself. Guards! Kill this idiot!"
msgstr "Att inte lyda en direkt order från en högre officer är förräderi. Jag har inte tid att ställa dig inför krigsrätt, så jag sköter det här själv. Vakter! Döda den här idioten!"

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:110
msgid "Screw you!"
msgstr "Fan ta dig!"

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:111
msgid "The Fob is in the locker over there. Have the duty officer contact me once it's secured. Dismissed!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:112 dialog/ccmandr.msg:114 dialog/ccmandr.msg:116
msgid "Yes sir!"
msgstr "Ja, sir!"

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:113
msgid "Make it quick soldier, I don't have all day to stand around."
msgstr "Gör det snabbt soldat, jag har inte hela dagen på mig att stå här."

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:115 dialog/ccmandr.msg:124
msgid "Leave my locker alone or I will dish out some serious pain."
msgstr "Lämna mitt skåp ifred annars kommer jag att göra ditt liv smärtsamt."

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:117
msgid "This base is on alert and I don't recognize you. Show me your papers, soldier."
msgstr "Den här basen är i beredskap och jag känner inte igen dig. Visa mig dina papper, soldat."

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:118
msgid "What papers?"
msgstr "Vilka papper?"

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:119
msgid "You blow me!"
msgstr "Dra åt helvete!"

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:120
msgid "I don't seem to have them with me..."
msgstr "Jag verkar inte ha dem med mig..."

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:122
msgid "Wrong answer, maggot. You're to carry your papers with you at all times. You should know that!"
msgstr "Fel svar, kryp. Du ska alltid ha dina papper med dig. Det borde du veta!"

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:123 dialog/dcmetzge.msg:751 dialog/dctyler.msg:303
#: dialog/gcwooz.msg:705
msgid "Fuck you."
msgstr "Fan ta dig."

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:200
msgid ""
"Alright, let's get this over with--I don't like muties stinking up my office, and I got shit to do. Do you work\n"
" for the Salvatores? "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:201
msgid "None of your business, asshole."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:202
msgid "I work for no one."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:203
msgid "So what if I do?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:204
msgid "Yeah, I work for the Salvatores."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:205 dialog/ccmandr.msg:254
msgid "Before I answer any questions, I've got a few of my own."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:210 dialog/ccmandr.msg:260
msgid "I don't have time for this bullshit. Guards! Kill this mutie!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:220
msgid "So you're saying you're nothing more than a stray wasteland rat that happened to wander into one of our vertibirds?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:221
msgid "Uh, yeah, pretty much . . . except for that part about me being a rat."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:223
msgid ""
"No, I'm saying that this is all just a big misunderstanding. I don't know who you guys are, and I don't care.\n"
" So if you don't mind, I'll be moving along now."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:230
msgid "Good, if you're acting alone, then I don't have to waste another second of my time with you. Guards! Kill this mutie!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:240
msgid ""
"You're not leaving here alive, mutant. I couldn't risk you blabbing the location of this base to all your\n"
" wasteland friends, now could I? Guards! Kill this mutie!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:250
msgid ""
"Tell me what I want to know, and I'll make sure your death is quick and . . . relatively painless.\n"
" Did Salvatore put you up to this?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:251
msgid "Uhh . . . no? Wait, yeah. Maybe."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:252
msgid "Nope. Playing hide-and-seek in your flying machine was all my own idea. Genius, I know."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:253
msgid "Yeah, he thought he'd sweeten the trade by sending me along. What a deal, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:270
msgid ""
"That supposed to be funny, mutant? I think you'll be a lot funnier to me when you're a bleeding corpse. Guards!\n"
" Kill this mutie!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:280
msgid "Oh, you do? [He chuckles.] Well hell, why not? You're dying anyway. What do you want to know, mutant?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:281 dialog/qhprzrch.msg:213
msgid "Why do you keep calling me a mutant?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:282 dialog/fcnluke.msg:123 dialog/fcnluke.msg:126
msgid "Who the hell are you guys?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:283
msgid "Where am I? "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:284
msgid "How can I get some of that sweet armor?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:290
msgid ""
"Because you ARE. Sure, you might look kinda human, but don't let that fool you. You're still a mutant. You and\n"
" everyone else on the mainland. All tainted. Next question?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:300
msgid ""
"We're the Enclave--the last bastion of true humanity on this damn planet. We're the only ones still upholding\n"
" the honor of the ol' red, white, and blue. That's right, we're true patriots. We eat bald eagles and shit stars and\n"
" stripes. We're all that's left of the great United States of America. But we're enough. Oh, yeah, we're enough to set\n"
" things right. You can count on that, mutie. Next question?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:310
msgid ""
"This here's Navarro, our secret mainland base. We're sitting right on the coast of California and the pacific\n"
" ocean. Next question?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:320
msgid "By prying it off my dead body. Good luck with that, mutie. Next question?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccmandr.msg:330
msgid ""
"Good, 'cause I'm damn tired of wasting my breath on a mutant. In fact, this whole things a waste of my time,\n"
" because I don't give a flying fuck what you've got to say to me. Guards! Kill this mutie!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ccmaster.msg:100
msgid "Big surprise -- it looks like a guy in power armor."
msgstr "Stor överraskning -- det ser ut som en snubbe i kraftrustning."

#: dialog/ccmaster.msg:101
msgid "Yep, it's still a guy in power armor."
msgstr "Japp, det är fortfarande en snubbe i kraftrustning."

#: dialog/ccmaster.msg:102
msgid ""
"He's got some kind of insignia on his chest that different from any of the others you've seen\n"
" around here. "
msgstr ""
"Han har något slags märke på bröstet som skiljer sig från alla andra du sett\n"
" häromkring."

#: dialog/ccmaster.msg:103
msgid "<Skzzzt-spork> -the armory!"
msgstr "<Skzzzt-spork> -vapenförrådet!"

#: dialog/ccmaster.msg:104
msgid "What the- <zzzzaaark!>>"
msgstr "Vad i- <zzzzaaark!>>"

#: dialog/ccmaster.msg:105
msgid ""
"(So, Sarge sent you. Something about needing power armor. Well, all I got is one in for\n"
" maintenance. Might have a few problems still, so take it easy. Just sign here.)"
msgstr ""
"(Så, Sergeanten skickade dig. Nåt om att behöva en kraftrustning. Tja, allt jag har är en inne för\n"
" underhåll. Kan ha några problem fortfarande, så ta det lugnt. Skriv bara under här.)"

#: dialog/ccmaster.msg:106
msgid "Uh... Could you repeat that?"
msgstr "Eh... Kan du upprepa det?"

#: dialog/ccmaster.msg:107
msgid "I think there's something wrong with your suit."
msgstr "Jag tror att det är något fel på din rustning."

#: dialog/ccmaster.msg:108
msgid "Sure, I'll do that."
msgstr "Visst, det ska jag göra."

#: dialog/ccmaster.msg:109
msgid "No way. Forget it."
msgstr "Inte en chans. Glöm det."

#: dialog/ccmaster.msg:110
msgid "You the guy Arch radioed about?"
msgstr "E du snubben Arch ropa' in om?"

#: dialog/ccmaster.msg:111
msgid "Are you sure you're not the guy?"
msgstr "Är du säker på att du inte är killen?"

#: dialog/ccmaster.msg:112 dialog/ccmaster.msg:130 dialog/ccmaster.msg:134
#: dialog/ccmaster.msg:167 dialog/dcaddct2.msg:200 dialog/dcbilly.msg:414
#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:157 dialog/dcmaggie.msg:188 dialog/dcrebecc.msg:451
#: dialog/dcrebecc.msg:452 dialog/dcslave.msg:500 dialog/dcslave.msg:605
#: dialog/dcsmitty.msg:301 dialog/dcsmitty.msg:311 dialog/dcsmitty.msg:381
#: dialog/epac4.msg:241 dialog/gcwooz.msg:321 dialog/kcardin.msg:2001
#: dialog/kcsulik.msg:115 dialog/nchollyf.msg:307 dialog/nchollyf.msg:320
#: dialog/qcbird.msg:112 dialog/qccurlng.msg:250
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Vadå?"

#: dialog/ccmaster.msg:115 dialog/ccmaster.msg:119 dialog/fcelrind.msg:103
msgid "Who are you? What are you doing here?"
msgstr "Vem är du? Vad gör du här?"

#: dialog/ccmaster.msg:116 dialog/ccmaster.msg:120 dialog/dcmetzge.msg:215
#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:682 dialog/dcmetzge.msg:711 dialog/dcorphan.msg:201
#: dialog/dcrebecc.msg:219 dialog/dcrebecc.msg:256 dialog/dcslave.msg:606
#: dialog/dcslvgrt.msg:246 dialog/dcstory2.msg:159 dialog/dcvic.msg:4004
#: dialog/hcjacob.msg:183 dialog/ncorvill.msg:701
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Vad?"

#: dialog/ccmaster.msg:117 dialog/ccmaster.msg:121
msgid "Uh... I'm new here?"
msgstr "Eh... jag är ny här?"

#: dialog/ccmaster.msg:118 dialog/ccmaster.msg:122
msgid "Peek-a-boo!"
msgstr "Tittut!"

#: dialog/ccmaster.msg:123
msgid "What do you mean? This suit's working fine! You gonna sign the papers or not?"
msgstr "Vad menar du med det? Den här rustningen fungerar bra! Ska du skriva på papperna eller inte?"

#: dialog/ccmaster.msg:124
msgid "I'm not understanding a word of this."
msgstr "Jag förstår inte ett ord av det här."

#: dialog/ccmaster.msg:125
msgid "Your speaker's broken."
msgstr "Din högtalare är trasig."

#: dialog/ccmaster.msg:126 dialog/scratch.msg:104
msgid "Sure, whatever."
msgstr "Visst."

#: dialog/ccmaster.msg:127
msgid "To hell with this!"
msgstr "Åt helvete med det här!"

#: dialog/ccmaster.msg:128
msgid "(What, are you deaf? I said I got a suit; just sign here.)"
msgstr "(Vad, är du döv? Jag sa att jag har en rustning; skriv bara på här.)"

#: dialog/ccmaster.msg:129
msgid "Clown, are you? Well, I don't need this. You explain to Sarge why you don't have a uniform!"
msgstr "Är du en clown? Tja, jag behöver inte det här. Förklara för sergeanten varför du inte har en uniform!"

#: dialog/ccmaster.msg:131
msgid "Okay, fine. I'll do it."
msgstr "Okej, bra. Jag ska göra det."

#: dialog/ccmaster.msg:132
msgid "Just forget it, okay?"
msgstr "Glöm det bara, okej?"

#: dialog/ccmaster.msg:133
msgid ""
"Your speaker's not broken. I can hear you just fine. Just sign the papers and we can get this\n"
" done."
msgstr ""
"Din högtalare är inte trasig. Jag hör dig alldeles utmärkt. Skriv bara under papperna så kan vi få det här\n"
" gjort."

#: dialog/ccmaster.msg:135
msgid "Fine, I give up!"
msgstr "Okej, jag ger upp!"

#: dialog/ccmaster.msg:136
msgid "You want me to what? I'm not that kind of person!"
msgstr "Du vill att jag ska göra vadå? Jag är inte den sortens person!"

#: dialog/ccmaster.msg:137
msgid "Okay, what's your name?"
msgstr "Okej, vad heter du?"

#: dialog/ccmaster.msg:138 dialog/ccmaster.msg:152 dialog/ccmaster.msg:190
