#: dialog/eastereg.msg:100
msgid "You see MIBoba Fe88."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:101
msgid "You see a tough, ruthless bounty hunter."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:110
msgid "You see a tough, ruthless bounty hunter. He doesn't look like he talks much. He helped with the new scripts and ideas. And with killing people."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:200
msgid "You see Hivan Zolo."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:201
msgid "A scruffy lookin', but handsome rogue."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:210
msgid ""
"Kid, I've flown from one side of this galaxy to the other, and I've seen a lot of strange stuff, but I've never seen *anything* to make me believe that there's one all-powerful Force controlling everything.\n"
" 'Cause no mystical energy field controls *my* destiny. It's all a lot of simple tricks and nonsense. Hokey religions and ancient weapons are no match for a good blaster at your side. I can tell when a guy is handy\n"
" with a gun, so take this. Trust me: it'll come in handy when you've got a price on your head. (He hands you a blaster.)"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:211
msgid "My real name is Ivan Zaharath."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:212
msgid "I translated the RP into Polski for the benefit of the great and powerful Republic of Poland ... I mean Rebel Alliance."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:213
msgid "Laugh it up, fuzzball."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:214
msgid "Hokey religions and ancient weapons are no match for a good blaster at your side, kid."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:215
msgid "Who're you callin' 'scruffy lookin'!?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:300
msgid "You see Contie-bacca."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:301
msgid "He looks like a walking carpet."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:310
msgid "Roow rooo arrrrr rooow."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:311
msgid "Rrrrrrrrrrrrr .... squeak!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:312
msgid "Nowrrrrragh."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:313
msgid "Yawrrrk!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:314
msgid "Roow rooo Nowrrrrragh!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:315
msgid "He says he's Continuum, and he made new & unique graphics."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:316
msgid "He says he made them using 3D modeling. He's quite clever you know. For a human."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:317
msgid "He says he's not speaking Czech-speak, though it does sound a bit like baby-talk."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:318
msgid "He says it's not a crossbow, it's a blaster. And no you can't have it."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:319
msgid "He says you should thank him for bringing the sub back into the game."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:400
msgid "You see Darek Vader."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:401
msgid "This guy looks hard as hell and appears to be more machine than man."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:410
msgid "I'm Darek. I helped answer a million noob questions for Obi-Wan-Killap."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:411
msgid "Join me! Together we can rule the galaxy!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:412
msgid "Did you know that the great Obi-Wan-Killap asked ME for help?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:413
msgid "Don't tell Obi-Wan-Killap, but I think he might be losing his mind."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:414
msgid "I helped squash several nasty bugs. You can thank me later."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:500
msgid "You see Jotisz the Hutt."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:501
msgid "This guy is big, fat and green."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:510
msgid ""
"I'm Jotisz the Hutt. I may look like a big fat green slug, but I actually helped create those nice new armored threads your buddy Sulik is wearing.\n"
" Those were created by Yosan12 and me. I know! And with these stubby hands!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:511
msgid ""
"I'm Jotisz the Hutt. I may look like a big fat green slug, but I actually helped create those nice new armored threads your buddy... hey where\n"
" is Sulik? You should go get him and see how he looks. His threads were created by Yosan12 and me. I know! And with these stubby hands!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:512
msgid "*whistles* I'm a big fat green slug..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:513
msgid "In case you didn't notice, I'm suspiciously easy to strangle."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:514
msgid "Now, where did I put Leia...?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:600
msgid "You see R2Qwerty."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:601
msgid "A feisty little robot. He flashes and beeps."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:610
msgid "Beep beep!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:611
msgid "Rrrrrr beep Rrrrwow!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:612
msgid "*flashes and jiggles excitedly*"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:613
msgid "Crossbows! Tactics! Crossbows!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:700
msgid "You see Chris3ParksO."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:701
msgid "A shiny gold humanoid robot. He looks surprised."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:710
msgid "Hi, I'm Chris3ParksO, human-cyborg relations. I am well versed in over 3 million programming languages."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:711
msgid "I helped lay the groundwork for the Umbra Tribe and the EPA."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:712
msgid "This is R2QWERTY: my faithful sidekick. He created new critters and graphics."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:800
msgid "You see Yosan12."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:801
msgid "A little green guy. He looks OLD."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:810
msgid ""
"Yosan12 am I. Created the NPC armor mod I did. Lift Xwing from swamp did I too. Talk in strange very also way do I.\n"
" Difficult to understand, hmmm? Hagh Hah ha! Also, created the new Sniper, Wakizashi and lightsaber animations I did. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:811
msgid "Remember: anger, fear, hatred: of the dark side are they."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:812
msgid "When gone am I, a little fuzzy glowing ghost will I become."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:813
msgid "Once, a puppet with wisdom and character was I. Now, a hollow, CGI character for the kids I have become."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:814
msgid "Stupid JarJar Binks is."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:900
msgid "You see Obi-Wan-Killap."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:901
msgid "He seems like a kindly old man with something slightly bear-like about him."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:910
msgid "Greetings "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:911
msgid ". I see you've been doing quite well for yourself. I'm Obi-Wan-Killap: I make Fallout work like it should have from the very beginning."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:912
msgid "Wow. Well, thank you for that, Mr. Killap. How did you do it?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:913
msgid "What the Hell is Fallout?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:914
msgid "Ok. And who, pray tell, are these other people?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:920
msgid ""
"I am a Programming Master, skilled in the way of The Source. It is an energy field created by all digital things. It surrounds us and penetrates us.\n"
" It binds the galaxy together. You, me - the tree - the rock. Pixilated beings are we....not this crude matter *pokes you*.\n"
" I have learned to use this power through years of staring at a computer screen."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:921
msgid "Wow. Our shaman always said there was more to this world than what I can see, hear, touch, taste and feel. Can you teach me to use the power of The Source?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:922
msgid "I think I've heard enough religious mumbo-jumbo to keep me stocked for another nuclear winter. Frankly, I prefer a plasma pistol at my side."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:923
msgid "Oh great, another kookie religious nutbag. I'm outta here."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:930
msgid ""
"Fallout is the world you are in. I created it, or at least, made it work like it was supposed to. You see, not\n"
" long ago, this world was in chaos. Travelers that came here were often killed by the huge number of bugs that roamed\n"
" the wasteland corrupting saved games indiscriminately. The gods of this world had been careless. But then I came, and,\n"
" using the power of The Source, my friends and I cleaned up the wasteland. You could say I am the savior. I am seen by\n"
" many as a hero: The Bear Dude."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:931
msgid ""
"I see. Well, actually, I was under the impression I was the hero of this story. I run around looting shit and killing people - you know - heroically. Oh, and I talk to them sometimes, but that part can get tiresome.\n"
" I just click through it to get to the fun bit."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:932
msgid "Great work, Mr. Killap. I really appreciate all your time and hard work spent cleaning up the wasteland. If what you say is true, then you should know that I, too, am a hero. In fact, I've squashed quite a few bugs myself."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:935
msgid "And we are grateful that you have destroyed the Enclave. You are the true hero here."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:936
msgid "Whatever gets you through the day."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:937
msgid "So, how exactly did you clean up this world?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:938
msgid "Who, pray tell, are these other people?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:940
msgid ""
"These are my companions. They helped me improve this world: MIBoba Fe88, Hivan Zolo, Contie-bacca, Darek Vader, Jotisz the Hutt,\n"
" R2Qwerty, Chris3ParksO, Yosan12, Empress Timeslip, Luke Skynet, Mon-Morticia, Kanhef, HawkEyE, Adam Dravean, Mr. Wolna, encinodude,\n"
" Minigun Jim, Bofast, Pixote, Mash, Mikael Grizzly, x'il, Per, and the Masses. They all helped in the great project to restore\n"
" this world from the bug infestation. The only good bug is a dead bug."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:941
msgid "Hmm. those names somehow sound familiar... Well, I think I'll go talk to them."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:950
msgid "Indeed I can. You must learn to use your feelings: let go of your conscious mind. Turn off the monitor. Close your eyes, and FEEL The Source flowing through the mouse ... (Follow his instructions.)"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:951
msgid "You lack the experience to start training. Return to me when you've at least learned some basic Programming, young padawan."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:960
msgid "As you wish, young "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:961
msgid ". But before you go on your way, remember this: Many of the truths we cling to depend greatly on our own point of view. Now go, and may The Source be with you."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:962
msgid ""
". Your actions on your quest have proved you good, kind and honest. Take this to aid you in your struggle against the Dark Side: it is your ancestor's light saber. This is the weapon of a Java Knight.\n"
" Not as clumsy or random as a blaster; an elegant weapon for a more civilized age. And though you may be tempted to use it to arbitrarily cut people in half for entertainment, you should use it only in service of good.\n"
" Good luck, and may The Source be with you, my friend."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:963
msgid "What?! My ancestor, The Vault Dweller, had one of these?! I don't remember finding this in Fallout 1! *run off to check*"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:964
msgid "Thank you, Mr. Bear Dude. For everything. May The Source be with you too."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1000
msgid "You see Empress Timeslip."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1001
msgid "You see a mean-looking cloaked figure with a stoop."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1010
msgid ""
"I'm Empress Timeslip. I'm a Programming Master, skilled in the way of The Source. It was I who allowed Obi-Wan-Killap's spies to steal my\n"
" engine fixes to greatly improve the stability of this world, and correct FOOLISH AND STUPID MISTAKES left by the original ones."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1011
msgid "Indeed, my master. Tell me about yourself oh great one."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1012
msgid "Wow. You're creepy. And your face looks awful."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1013
msgid "That's nice. Gotta go."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1020
msgid ""
"I can change that which is hardcoded into The Source with the merest thought, and determine the fate of entire universes!\n"
" An entire legion of my best bug fixes await you in the rest of your adventure. I'm master of the Dark side of The Source."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1021
msgid ""
"Silence! Years of working in the dark may have distorted my looks, but in this mind are the powers of a God! Using The Source I create weather, mastered entire worlds and tweak that which cannot be tweaked!\n"
" It was I who allowed the Evil Beth to rule the RPG world with my mods. Everything that has transpired has done so according to MY desires."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1022
msgid "Sauce? What kind of sauce? Are you saying cooking is the key to controlling the universe? Whatever you say, chef."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1023
msgid "Yeah yeah. Jeeze, whatever you say. I think I will leave now."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1024
msgid "Uh, ok. that's great. Well, I need to go..erm ...water my plants..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1030
msgid "Ignorant fool. Your overconfidence is your weakness, and my faith in your friends is ... er ... mine. *looks confused* Be gone from my sight!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1040
msgid ""
"Wait! You will leave IF and WHEN I decide. In case you haven't noticed, you have been exceedingly evil in your quest.\n"
" Your hate has made you powerful and your character has developed according to my desires. Anger, fear, hatred ... of the dark side are they.\n"
" Now you will become my apprentice and fulfill your place AT MY SIDE!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1041
msgid "As you wish, my master. I'm at your bidding."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1042 dialog/epac17.msg:805 dialog/scelise.msg:292
#: dialog/tribec1.msg:373
msgid "Not interested. Bye."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1045
msgid "Go forth and wreak havoc my child."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1046
msgid "Begone!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1050
msgid "Eeeeeeexcellent. Then take this Java weapon. Use it. Kill indiscriminately. USE YOUR AGRRESSIVE FEELINGS, CHILD! (He hands you a red lightsaber.)"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1051
msgid "So.... basically carry on as I've been doing. No problem. Bye!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1052
msgid "I will not fail you, my master."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1053
msgid "Kill everything? you mean ... even the children?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1060
msgid "ESPECIALLY the children."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1100
msgid "You see Luke Skynet."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1101
msgid "A hooded figure who looks quietly confident."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1110
msgid "I'm Luke Skynet: I'm here to rescue you."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1111
msgid "Rescue me?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1112
msgid "Do I look like a princess? What do you mean 'rescue'?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1113
msgid "Right. I think you're the one that needs rescuing, pal... from your own movie career. Bye."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1120
msgid "Yes, I'm here to rescue you. I created the basis to what you see at the Abbey, and there you will find salvation. There you will find the light!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1121
msgid "I've actually already been there. I 'rescued' a lot stuff from getting lost in all those drawers and containers."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1122
msgid "Amen brother. Thank you for aiding in the creation of that place of peace and solace. And just when I needed to rest my radiated feet and seek spiritual rejuvenation."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1123
msgid "I remember that place. No qualified shaman though, and no herb-superb. I don't know who's idea of a spiritual center that is, but it's not mine."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1124
msgid "Oh? And where is this place that can rescue me?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1125
msgid "Cuck-oo! Bye bye now!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1130
msgid "You should return there again. It is a safe haven in these harsh Wastes."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1131
msgid "I'm on my way, Mr. Skynet. Thanks for everything. Goodbye."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1132
msgid "Well, I think YOU should go there Skybrain, and stay there. I'm outta here. Freak."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1135
msgid "Here. (He shows you on your Pip-Boy). You should go there now."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1138
msgid "The Abbey is a place of solitude."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1139
msgid "Be careful out there."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1200
msgid "You see Mon-Morticia."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1201
msgid "A very diplomatic looking lady."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:1210
msgid "I helped with writing a walkthrough to aid all the noobs on their new adventures in this improved world."
msgstr ""

