msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:2000
msgid "You see Pixote."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:2001
msgid "You see a noble repair bot."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:2010
msgid "[The robot nods as you approach.] Hello there. Are you enjoying your time in this world?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:2011
msgid "Yes I am. Thanks for asking."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:2012
msgid "Not really. Things could be better."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:2013
msgid "I'm not in the mood to chat. Bye."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:2020
msgid "That's great to hear! I hope all the hard work I have done to make each location appear as unique and detailed as possible is in some way responsible for your happiness. It took a lot of work to tidy things up, but the overall atmosphere and appearance is top notch now. Don't you agree?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:2021
msgid "Oh, definitely. Everything looks amazing. You're quite talented!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:2022
msgid "Meh, it's alright."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:2023 dialog/eastereg.msg:2033
msgid "That's nice. Bye."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:2030
msgid ""
"I'm sorry to hear that. Perhaps you haven't taken a good look at the world around you. I have done much\n"
" to make each location appear as unique and detailed as possible. Maybe if you look at the details, this will lift your\n"
" spirits. It took a lot of work to tidy things up, but the overall atmosphere and appearance is top notch now.\n"
" Don't you agree?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:2031
msgid "Now that you mention it, I did notice things look a lot nicer now."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:2032
msgid "Didn't really notice."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:2040
msgid ""
"[The robot rocks back and forth with glee.] I'm glad you like it. Well, I must be going now. I've got more goodies\n"
" to unleash upon this world."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:2041
msgid "Alright. Take care."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:2050
msgid ""
"[The robot's head lowers in sadness.] Well, my work isn't for everyone I suppose. Now, if you'll excuse me,\n"
" I must be going. I've got more goodies to unleash upon this world."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:2051 dialog/ecabolst.msg:338 dialog/ecabolst.msg:363
#: dialog/epac17.msg:851 dialog/fcoz9.msg:157 dialog/hcliz.msg:161
#: dialog/hcsteve.msg:166 dialog/ncpitbos.msg:512 dialog/tribec1.msg:302
#: dialog/tribec1.msg:444 dialog/tribec1.msg:454 dialog/vibaron.msg:411
msgid "Whatever. Bye."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:2060
msgid "I so enjoy creating new things."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:2061
msgid "So many new details now. So beautiful."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:2100
msgid "You see Mash."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:2101
msgid "He nods at you."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:2110
msgid ""
"Greetings! Glad you've made it this far. I hope you are enjoying the expanded visible size of this world. Not enough\n"
" of this world could be shown at any one time. I changed all this though. Empress Timeslip and I are masters of the\n"
" Source. He and I have brought this old world into a new era."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:2111
msgid "Wow, thanks for that. Everything is a lot better. Sometimes a bit too small, but I can easily adjust that."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:2120
msgid ""
"I'm glad you are enjoying my hard work. I also made it possible to change appearances. No longer are you stuck\n"
" with a specific race or hair type. Yosan12, x'il, and others made the physical appearances themselves, but I, with the\n"
" help of Empress Timeslip, dug deep into the Source to make it all possible. I see that you have taken advantage of this\n"
" new ability. Outstanding!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:2121
msgid "Oh, I love my new looks. Thanks for that!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:2122 dialog/eastereg.msg:2132
msgid "Right. Goodbye."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:2130
msgid ""
"I'm glad you are enjoying my hard work. I also made it possible to change appearances. No longer are you stuck\n"
" with a specific race or hair type. Yosan12, x'il, and others made the physical appearances themselves, but I, with the\n"
" help of Empress Timeslip, dug deep into the Source to make it all possible. I see that you have not taken advantage of\n"
" this feature. Just know that it is there and available. A great place to test it out is at the EPA. Oh, what fun!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:2131
msgid "I'll keep that in mind. Thanks."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:2140
msgid "Most excellent. Well, you take care."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:2150
msgid "The Source is tricky, but I can handle it."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:2151
msgid "Enjoy the expanded visibility of this world!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/eastereg.msg:2152
msgid "Enjoy the new you!"
msgstr ""

