#: dialog/epac10.msg:1700
msgid ""
"Well, I can do wondrous things with knives. It's like an art. There's something very special about the way a\n"
" blade slices into flesh, you know what I mean?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/epac10.msg:1701
msgid "Uh... yeah, sure. Anything else you can use? Feel free to be less creepy about it this time."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/epac10.msg:1702
msgid ""
"Well, my Uncle was one of them military hard-asses. He trained me with pistols and SMGs, and I even got to toy\n"
" around with some energy weapon prototypes they were working on. He thought I'd follow in his footsteps and be a\n"
" puppet for Uncle Sam, but I, uh... Let's just say I went down a different path."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/epac10.msg:1703
msgid "That sounds alright. Anything else?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/epac10.msg:1704
msgid ""
"I've been known to beat some ass with good 'ol fisticuffs. When I was a teen, I tried my hand at Karate for\n"
" awhile, but they kept feeding me all this shit about being more disciplined, so I told 'em to fuck off. Anything else you need to know?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/epac10.msg:1705
msgid "That should cover it. Thanks."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/epac10.msg:1800 dialog/qcgranit.msg:109
msgid "I'm good to go."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/epac10.msg:1801
msgid "I've been better, but I can handle it."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/epac10.msg:1802
msgid "I'm not feeling very good."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/epac10.msg:1803
msgid "I think I hear the King calling. I can see the light..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/epac10.msg:1900
msgid "No problem. But you're going to feel a lot less cool without me around. Just saying..."
