#: dialog/epai13.msg:220
msgid ""
"Log Entry #87983: It's finally happened. They've launched their nukes at us and we've launched ours at them.\n"
" Brass won't go into detail, but it's probably already Judgment Day topside by now. Radio communications have been disrupted\n"
" indefinitely. Good thing I've grown used to this place. I've got no illusions about ever seeing the surface again."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/epai13.msg:222
msgid ""
"They brought in a woman to be cryoed. Didn't say why; only that it was top secret business. She was quite the looker.\n"
" Petite, Chinese-looking, and there was something about her eyes. She took down two secret service agents when she found\n"
" out what we had in mind. Caught them off guard and opened them both up with one of Delnay's scalpels, Jesus Christ. That was\n"
" a sight for tired eyes. The third one managed to subdue her. It's not like she wouldn't be spending the rest of her\n"
" life down here if she'd managed to kill them all, anyway. She's unconscious now and they're prepping her tank.\n"
" It's right next to that psychopath Patrick's, too. What a shame. I would've liked to have gotten to know her better.\n"
" -Dr. David Kimble, 10/23/2077"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/epai13.msg:230
msgid ""
"Log Entry #81977: Dexter \"Dex\" Patrick is a rather interesting specimen. He's a narcissistic, woman hating,\n"
" sociopathic murderer, known to occasionally dabble in necrophilia and cannibalism. He is cold hearted to the extreme,\n"
" showing no remorse for his victims, who ranged from innocent children to the elderly and disabled. His preferred targets\n"
" were attractive young women, who he'd usually seduce into intercourse before brutally dispatching them."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/epai13.msg:232
msgid ""
"Despite his antisocial behavior, he remains remarkably sociable, even charming. In fact, several female\n"
" staff members seem to be taken with him, despite knowing the numerous atrocities he's committed. Dex's confirmed\n"
" victims is currently 68, though he has boasted the actual number is well into the triple digits.\n"
" While Dex has proven to be a compulsive liar, I still find it difficult to doubt the validity of his claim."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/epai13.msg:234
msgid ""
"The only emotional attachment Dex seems to have is for a mid-20th century rock 'n roll idol, whom he admires\n"
" as a role model and perhaps even as a father figure. He's also shown an unhealthy attachment to a severed human ear,\n"
" which we have identified as belonging to Vicky Safron, Dex's high school sweet heart and one of his early victims.\n"
" He claims to keep the ear in his pocket so Vicky can hear the screams of all his victims."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/epai13.msg:236
msgid ""
"I've decided to have Dexter frozen for the time being, as the government has re-routed funds away from our\n"
" project in order to further fuel the war effort, and my team is being re-assigned to other locations. Let it be noted\n"
" that I deem this a terrible mis-step, as our studies on the nature of human evil are progressing swiftly and I believe\n"
" we are near a major breakthrough that would be far more valuable to our government than the production of more \"tin suits\".\n"
" But I digress."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/epai13.msg:238
msgid ""
"Dex is to remain frozen here until the powers-that-be come to their senses and resurrect this vastly important\n"
" project. I only hope I'm still around to resume my work when that day comes.\n"
" -Dr. Dustin C. Delnay, 04/13/2075"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/epai13.msg:240
msgid ""
"Log Entry #80052: Sergeant Christopher \"Cat\" Jules was assigned to the EPA military security detail on 17/02/2074.\n"
" Prior to this, he was attached to a reconnaissance unit of the 205th Airborne. The Sergeant has an impressive combat record,\n"
" and is one of the highest-graded energy arms and unarmed combat specialists in his unit. However, these achievements are\n"
" marred by an equally long history of accusations of very petty theft, repeated counts of being out of uniform, and an attitude\n"
" of extreme arrogance to superior officers."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/epai13.msg:242
msgid ""
"Sgt. Jules was recruited as a test subject for the Human Reflex Enhancement Project on 10/05/2075 in exchange for the removal of\n"
" some of these reports from his file. Complications arose from the initial trial and Sgt. Jules was sedated for the safety\n"
" of himself those around him."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/epai13.msg:244
msgid ""
"A few days have passed and Sgt. Jules appears to be in good health, but he has developed lengthened canines and\n"
" certain eccentric characteristics in addition to the project goals of improved reflexes and heightened sensory capability.\n"
" I have logged several reports with the base Commander requesting further funding, but alas it seems there are those who do not\n"
" wish for my project to continue. This is quite a shame, since the tissue samples and psych reports for Sgt. Jules indicate\n"
" only minor disfigurement and a tendency to a slightly reduced attention span. Other than this, he is perfectly fit\n"
" for service and in fact, he is likely more capable than before as a result of the treatment. Until more funding is\n"
" received for this project, Sgt. Jules shall remain in suspended animation.\n"
" -Dr. R.D. Crichton, 11/04/2075"
msgstr ""

