msgstr ""

#: dialog/epai37.msg:101
msgid "This Auto-Doc appears to have been modified to perform experimental appearance modifications."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/epai37.msg:200
msgid ""
"[The machine addresses you as you approach.] Welcome, Test Subject. Thank you for volunteering your flesh for\n"
" science. Please, step inside me and we can begin."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/epai37.msg:201
msgid "Whoa, I never said I was volunteering anything. Now before I step anywhere, why don't you tell me exactly what you do?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/epai37.msg:202
msgid "[Shrug.] Alright. [Step into the device.]"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/epai37.msg:203
msgid "You've got me confused with someone else. Bye."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/epai37.msg:300
msgid "Welcome back, Test Subject. Please, step inside me and we can begin."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/epai37.msg:301
msgid "Before I step anywhere, why don't you tell me exactly what you do?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/epai37.msg:302 dialog/epai37.msg:403
msgid "Alright. [Step into the device.]"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/epai37.msg:303
msgid "I don't think so. Bye."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/epai37.msg:400
msgid ""
"I'm the newest prototype of Auto-Doc technology, developed by Dr. Wood. I specialize in extreme body\n"
" modification--the ultimate makeover. There's no need to be nervous, as my patient death rate is significantly lower\n"
" than the previous prototype. Don't be shy, step inside me and we can begin."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/epai37.msg:401
msgid "You're not touching me. Bye."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/epai37.msg:402
msgid "I'd love to, but I really need to get going. Sorry."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/epai37.msg:410
msgid "Please make your selection. Due to being an early prototype, I can only offer you limited choices. Sorry."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/epai37.msg:411
msgid "Alter Gender."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/epai37.msg:412
