msgstr ""

#: dialog/fcdkwrk2.msg:213
msgid "I'm sorry things have been rough for you, but it might help to talk about it. If you're willing to talk, then I'm willing to listen."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/fcdkwrk2.msg:214
msgid "All right Mr. Melodrama, I'm gonna leave now before you make me depressed. Bye."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/fcdkwrk2.msg:220
msgid ""
"Fine. You want to know my problem. I'll tell you. Two years ago, my brother, who looks very similar to me, had\n"
" an affair with a local gang leader's girlfriend. The gang leader found out about it and my brother fled town. The gang\n"
" caught me instead, and, thinking I was my brother, they severed my penis as punishment. Now I piss through a tube."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/fcdkwrk2.msg:221
msgid "Oh, well-- "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/fcdkwrk2.msg:230
msgid ""
"Oh no! I'm not done yet. Then my beautiful girlfriend left me, because I was no longer a \"real man\" and could not\n"
" satisfy her. She then married my next door neighbor, who also happens to be my boss. Now, all day at work, he orders me\n"
" around and mocks me with my co-workers. And every night I must try to fall asleep to the sound of him making love to the\n"
" girl I should have married."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/fcdkwrk2.msg:231
msgid "Hahaha! Holy shit, you're a loser. Why don't you do yourself a favor and just end it?"
