#: dialog/fsempter.msg:345
msgid ""
"From: Counterintelligence Division\n"
"                                  Rioting in Tibet and neighboring provinces continues, threatening the construction\n"
" of the Eastern Dragon satcom complex. President Xin orders military intervention against the populace. Following\n"
" significant insurgent casualties, the province is restored to Chinese control and the remaining insurgents are resettled."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/fsempter.msg:350
msgid ""
"From: Biochemical Warfare Division\n"
"                          Outbreak of epidemic in the Soviet Union threatens northern protectorates of the PRC. BioChem\n"
" WD advises quarantine andisolation of endangered territories. Potential resettlement location for insurgents, terrorists\n"
" and undesirables and harvesting area for new strains of biological weapons. Plan submitted to Party for approval."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/fsempter.msg:360
msgid ""
"From: Alaskan Front Commander, General Jingwei\n"
"                Strain #23-110 deployed against American troops, demoralizing and weakening their operational\n"
" strength. Requesting additional troops and Battlemaster armor for final push against the entrenched American forces at\n"
" the borders of Alaska."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/fsempter.msg:370
msgid ""
"From: Central Command\n"
"                                           American units deployed to mainland after evading our blockade of Japan.\n"
" Alaskan forces are to continue operations. Military forces in annexed territories are to augment the defense of home front.\n"
" Command authorizes the use of biological and chemical weapons on home soil - the foreign devils must be exterminated!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/fsempter.msg:380
msgid ""
"From: Red Dragon\n"
"                                                     Insurgency operations and terror strikes highly effective in\n"
" demoralizing the American population. Support for military operations overseas wanes as riots and protests are incited\n"
" across the American soil. Recommend strikes against designated research and military targets across the United States,\n"
" priority: Raven Rock, West Tek, Mariposa, Boulder, Institute."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/fsempter.msg:390
msgid ""
"From: Central Command\n"
"                                              American military superiority now clear - T-51b power armor units deployed\n"
" to mainland. The PLA has no appropriate counter and is losing ground daily. Chairman Cheng demands that Beijing stays in\n"
" Chinese hands - fortification is underway. Command orders intensification of guerilla operations behind enemy lines.\n"
" Operatives in all American Commonwealth are to prepare for staging insurgencies. Weapon and equipment shipments dispatched.\n"
" Priority target: Washington, DC, Columbia Commonwealth"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/fsempter.msg:400
msgid ""
"From: Party Chairman Cheng\n"
"                                         With the Alaskan Front's collapse and increasingly strong American presence on\n"
" Chinese soil defeat is imminent. According to resolution 636860 of the Communist Party of China, I am hereby ordering all\n"
" loyal military forces to commence nuclear operations against the Americans, mission outline R. Priority targets are\n"
" contained within operational directives. May our souls return to this Earth."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/fsempter.msg:410
msgid ""
"From: Central Command                                            All forces in position. Transmitting final confirmation\n"
" codes. Operation Youmíng is go."
msgstr ""

