#: dialog/gcrglow.msg:154
msgid "Does it feel cold to you?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/gcrguard.msg:102
msgid ""
"You see someone whose skin seems to have been burned with radiation. That much radiation looks\n"
" as though it should have killed them, but it they seem well enough. They look as though they're\n"
" standing guard here."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/gcrguard.msg:110
msgid "You better not try stealing again."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/gcrguard.msg:111
msgid "All you smoothskins are alike. You better not try stealing again."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/gcrguard.msg:112
msgid "Thought you might have left something in my pocket?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/gcrguard.msg:113
msgid "Cut that out, or I'll cut you out."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/gcrguard.msg:114
msgid "I wouldn't do that again, if I were you."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/gcrguard.msg:115
msgid "Cutting your hands off would only be a start."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/gcrguard.msg:116
msgid "Aren't you the friendly one?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/gcrguard.msg:117
msgid "I'm just looking for a reason. Gonna give me one?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/gcrguard.msg:120
msgid "Just what the hell are you sneaking around for?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/gcrguard.msg:121
msgid "If you're going to sneak, you're going to have to be a lot quieter than that."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/gcrguard.msg:122
msgid "Oh, aren't you the stealthy one."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/gcrguard.msg:123
msgid "You're good at your work. Uh huh."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/gcrguard.msg:124
msgid "Dumbass, just walk normally."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/gcrguard.msg:125
msgid "Another escapee from the Ministry of Silly Walks."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/gcrguard.msg:126
msgid "I can see you. In fact, I'm crushing your head."
