#: dialog/hcfranci.msg:111
msgid ""
"I'm Francis, remember? The arm-wrestling champion of the town? I've got a running bet that no one can\n"
" beat me."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/hcfranci.msg:112
msgid "I beat you! Me! Me!"
