#: dialog/mcjo.msg:628
msgid "other?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/mcjo.msg:800
msgid "We're gonna attack the Slags in "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/mcjo.msg:801
msgid " days unless you can convince me otherwise."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/mcjo.msg:802
msgid "We're gonna attack the Slags tomorrow unless you can convince me otherwise."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/mcjo.msg:803
msgid "We're attacking the Slags immediately! Are you in or out?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/mcjo.msg:804
msgid "Count me in!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/mcjo.msg:805
msgid "I've had enough of this, count me out!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/mcjo.msg:806
msgid "Let's attack now. The Slags have shown they can't be trusted."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/mcjo.msg:820
msgid "What can I do to help?"
msgstr "Vad kan jag göra för att hjälpa till?"

#: dialog/mcjo.msg:821
msgid "I want no part of this. I've fulfilled my end of the bargain. Tell me where the GECK is."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/mcjo.msg:850
msgid "I'll be back when I find out what happened to Karl."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/mcjo.msg:900
msgid "Thanks again, my friend, for saving our little town."
