#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:455
msgid ""
"Well... rumor has it he doesn't go out much. I thought I heard something 'bout him having a bad heart, so he doesn't\n"
" exert himself much. (Snorts.) Either that, or he doesn't like the sun."
