#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:456
msgid "Hmmmm. I had some other questions about Westin..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:457
msgid "Heart trouble, huh? Does he have a doctor? Does he take any medication for it?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:465
msgid ""
"(Smiles.) I like the way you think, tribal... well, I don't know if he takes any drugs for his heart, but I know he'd have\n"
" to be pretty damn careful about which ones he DID take with that heart o' his."
