#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:515
msgid "You stupid bastard..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:516
msgid "You dumb bitch..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:517
msgid ""
"you got some balls coming back here after fucking up the way you did in NCR. Why didn't you just tack a sign on Westin\n"
" saying, 'contract hit?' Yer gonna be a long time dying."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:519
msgid "Poor choice of last words, Bishop..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:525
msgid "Hey, tribal. That job's still open... if you want it. Pay's good. You interested?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:536
msgid "Here's your payment."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:537
msgid "Got any more work for me?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:538
msgid "This settle things between you and me now? If so, I'll be going."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:539
msgid "All right then. Pleasure doing business with you."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:545
msgid "Hold on a minute there, tribal... you did good. I got another job for you, IF you're interested."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:547
msgid "No, thanks. I'm not interested."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:550
msgid "(Checks you out for a moment, then nods.) "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:551
msgid "Yeah... I got a job for you. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:552
msgid ""
"I have another...\"problem\" down in NCR. Nail one, another pops up. This dead man's name is Carlson. He don't know he's\n"
" dead yet. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:553
msgid "I have a...\"problem\" down south in NCR. The dead man's name is Carlson. He don't know he's dead yet. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:554
msgid "Make it happen, and it's worth 500 to you."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:555
msgid "No problem. This Carlson is as good as dead."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:556
msgid "ANOTHER murder?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:565
msgid ""
"Ain't murder. Murder's an ugly word. This is business. Politics, if you will. Both two respectable institutions.\n"
" You want the job or what?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:575
msgid ""
"One more thing: I don't care if you go in there guns blazing with ol' Carlson. He's bound to be holed up there pretty\n"
" tight after Westin bought it, so it doesn't need to be pretty, it just needs to be DONE, capiche?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:576
msgid ""
"I don't care if you go in there guns blazing with ol' Carlson. He's holed up in his mansion tight, so it doesn't need\n"
" to be pretty, it just needs to be DONE, capiche?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:577
msgid ""
"And one more time in case I haven't made myself clear: I don't care HOW you whack this son of a bitch as long as he's\n"
" dead and stays that way."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:578
msgid "Understood. I'm on it."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:579
msgid "All RIGHT... I heard you the first time. I'm on it."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:580
msgid "If that's the way it's gotta be... now let's talk about that price."
