#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:581
msgid "I'm gonna need some info on this Carlson guy before I do anything."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:582
msgid "Oh, so NOW it's okay to go in with guns blazing? THAT would have been helpful with Westin. Forget this."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:583
msgid "Not interested. Find someone else."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:590
msgid "What the hell is this shit with you? I TOLD you the price. We AIN'T gonna negotiate. End of story... capiche?"
