#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:591
msgid ""
"Look, Bishop. I iced Westin. He was no cakewalk, but I DID it. None of your boys could've done it, or you would've\n"
" sent one of them. You want results? Then you talk to ME, and you better talk a price I want to hear."
