#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:660
msgid ""
"No, nothing like that... that I KNOW of. He's a paranoid bastard, sure, but I don't think he's sick or nothing. (Frowns.) Then\n"
" again, he's a pretty OLD guy, so his health can't be that great."
