#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:670
msgid ""
"(Glares at you.) He's the NCR Vice President. Don't let it bother you... get in one good shot, and they'll be fitting him\n"
" for a coffin. Just make sure you're ABLE to get in at least one good shot."
