#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:719
msgid "\"Bad policy?\" I'll SHOW you BAD POLICY, YOU SON OF A B --"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:725
msgid "All right then, bottom line: "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:726
msgid ""
"You got a taste for women? I can make sure you're NEVER lonely again. Maybe you don't like the bitches,\n"
" that's fine, I'll get you some glitterboys you can park your meat in."
