#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:727
msgid ""
"You got any young stud you fancy? I'll set you up with all the pretty boys you want. Or maybe you swing the other way,\n"
" eh? I'll make sure you have a partner for every day of the week."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:728
msgid "Keep talking."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:735
msgid ""
"You like to fly, get high, wire up? I can get you all of that. You want weapons, new hardware, a better piece of iron\n"
" to plug some schlep with? All that bullshit... yours. IF... (Raises a finger.) IF you join the family."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:736
msgid "Sounds good. Sign me up... boss."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:740
msgid "All right then...! You got a name you want to be called?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:745
msgid ""
"...I like it, I like it. Now, if you wanna cash in on your reputation, hit the bar downstairs, or head down Virgin\n"
" Street to the Cat's Paw. If you want to get some weapons, head on over to New Reno Arms."
