#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:815
msgid "Big desert, lots of character models look like me. Could be you're mistaken."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:820
msgid "Well, you must be some kind of ballsy mother fucker to waste all those boys by your lonesome. "
