#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:1840
msgid "I don't owe you anything, and I'm not going to do your dirty work. Understand?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:100
msgid "You see one of Bishop's men."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:150
msgid ""
"You see a rugged looking man dressed in leather armor. Numerous scars and gunshot wounds\n"
