#: dialog/ncprosti.msg:769 dialog/ncprosti.msg:999 dialog/ncprosti.msg:1173
#: dialog/ncprosti.msg:1346
msgid "You got the craving, I got the saving."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:423
msgid "Reno stays up ALL night, so you gotta be prepared."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:424
msgid "Reno can have a woman for breakfast. So can I."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:425
msgid "A woman can lose herself here. Let Jules be the one who finds you."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:426
msgid "This town can strip the unprepared... talk to me. I'll strip you proper."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:427
msgid "Yo! Come talk to me, sister!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:428
msgid "You new in town, sister? Worth your time to talk ta me, lady."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:429
msgid "You need Jet? You need guns? Sister, I got it all. All's you gotta do is ASK."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:450
msgid "(Smiles, displaying a gleaming gold tooth. His cologne is so strong it almost chokes you.) "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:451
msgid "WELCOME to the glittering city of New Reno, my brother!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:452
msgid "WELCOME to the glittering city of New Reno, my sister!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:453
msgid "Hunh? Wh-?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:454 dialog/ncliljes.msg:931 dialog/vcmoore.msg:109
msgid "And you are...?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:460
msgid ""
"Name's Jules, and I would be MOST pleased to make your acquaintance, show you around, and set you up with whatever\n"
" you're looking for."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:461
msgid ""
"Name's Jules, and may I say I have NEVER seen a more beautiful woman stride down this street until this moment. It'd\n"
" be MY pleasure to give you a tour of Reno and set you up with WHATEVER you're looking for."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:462
msgid "Hey, hey, hey, welcome back! What is it you need from Jules, my friend?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:463
msgid "Me looking for... um. Me forget again"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:465
msgid "All right. How can you help me?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:466
msgid "Well, I had some questions..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:467
msgid "Know what happened to Mr. Wright's son, Jules?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:468
msgid "Jules, have you seen my car? I parked it here a while ago, and now it's gone."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:469
msgid ""
"Look...\"Jules,\" is it? You obviously expect something out of this conversation, so level with me up front.\n"
" What are YOU looking for?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:470
msgid "So, I'm curious... what do YOU get out of playing tour guide, Jules?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:471
msgid "Not today, Jules, thanks."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:472
msgid "Nothing, thanks. See you, Jules."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:480
msgid "Eh... don't strain the brain, little brother. You just don't hurt yourself, now, hear?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:481
msgid "Eh... don't strain the brain, little sister. You just don't hurt yourself, now, hear?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:482
msgid "Hi tee hi tee hi tee ho"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:490
msgid ""
"I can get you ANYTHING you need, brother. If you need to fly, get high, slide down low in a luscious ho, Jules knows\n"
" where to GO. Question is: I gots the treasure, so what's YOUR pleasure?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:491
msgid ""
"Anything you need, Jules is the MAN, sister. If you need to fly, get high, slide down low, Jules knows where to GO.\n"
" Question is: I gots the treasure, so what's YOUR pleasure?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:492
msgid ""
"Anything you need, Jules is the MAN, my sweet sister. If you need to fly, get high, slide down low, Jules knows where\n"
" to GO. Question is: I gots the treasure, so what's YOUR pleasure?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:493
msgid "Sure thing, sure thing... I gots the treasure, so what's YOUR pleasure?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:494
msgid "Can you tell me a little about New Reno?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:495
msgid "Where can I get some drugs?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:496
msgid "I'm looking to buy some heavy firepower."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:497
msgid "I'm looking for supplies."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:498
msgid "I want to get laid."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:500
msgid "I'm looking for my tribe. They've been kidnapped."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:501
msgid "Do you know how to fix an oil tanker?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:515
msgid ""
"Can Jules TELL you 'bout New Reno? Hell, yes! FIRST thing you should know: Reno's ruled by four families: Mordinos,\n"
" the Salvatores, the Bishops and the Wrights. Each o' them got a slice of th' Reno pie."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:516
msgid "Reno's got four families: Mordinos, Salvatores, Bishops, Wrights. Each o' them got a slice of th' Reno pie."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:517
msgid "Tell me about the families."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:518
msgid "What about the law?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:519 dialog/nclabish.msg:281
msgid "Actually, I had some other questions..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:520
msgid "Interesting. Thanks for talking with me."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:525
msgid "Ain't no law, ain't no po-lice, ain't no sheriff, ain't no government body. JUST the families."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:527
msgid "Who keeps order in Reno then?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:535
msgid ""
"The Families keep things running smooth. They don't LIKE trouble in Reno 'cause it hurts the tourist trade, and that\n"
" means less money for them. Don't make trouble and cover yer bets, you'll stay off Golgotha."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:537 dialog/ncrenesc.msg:856
msgid "Golgotha?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:545
msgid ""
"Yeah, this graveyard outside o' town. It's where they put debtors and people who've crossed the families.\n"
" They just string 'em up on posts and let 'em die slowly in the sun. Not my choice a' dying. Stinks like hell out there."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:548
msgid "Sounds great. Thanks for the information."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:555
msgid "Well, now, ANOTHER thing you gotta know about New Reno is nothin's free. If it is, ex-amine the merchandise."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:556
msgid "Well, now, that kind of info don't come cheap. You got the chips? Then you got my attention."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:557
msgid "Pay him 25 chips."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:558
msgid "Pay him 50 chips."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:559
msgid "Pay him 75 chips."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:560
msgid "Pay him 100 chips."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:561
msgid "Actually, I had some other... non-family... related questions."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:562
msgid "Looks like I can't afford any information right now. I'll be back when I have some chips."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:563
msgid "I'll keep that in mind. Thanks for the tip, Jules."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:575
msgid "(Jules pockets the chips so quickly, you swear they vanished.) So... which of the fine families interests you today?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:576
msgid "(Jules pockets the chips.) So... which family you got the need to know about?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:577 dialog/nhmyron.msg:1697
msgid "Tell me about the Mordino Family."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:578
msgid "Tell me about the Salvatore Family."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:579
msgid "Tell me about the Bishop Family."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:580
msgid "Tell me about the Wright Family."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:582
msgid "Actually, nevermind. We'll talk some other time."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:590
msgid "(Holds up two fingers.) The Mordinos are a two-headed beast, friend, an' each head's named Jesus Mordino."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:592
msgid "I always suspected Jesus had ties to organized crime."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:594
msgid "Let's go back to the other families."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:596
msgid "Actually, nevermind. Thanks for talking with me."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:615
msgid ""
"There's the father, Big Jesus Mordino, and the son, Lil' Jesus, and both are the meanest sons of bitches you ever met.\n"
" Used to be slaves here, but they turned the tables years ago and carved out their own lil' empire."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:616
msgid "How big is their \"empire?\""
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:625
msgid ""
"They own the Desperado just down the street. Can't miss it. They also got the biggest supply of Jet in ALL o' New Reno.\n"
" So if you got the urge to fly..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:626
msgid "Speaking of which, do you know where can I get some drugs around here?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:627
msgid "How come the Mordinos have the biggest supply of Jet?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:628
msgid "Tell me about the other families."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:635
msgid ""
"They're on top of the pile, friend. Ain't no more reason than that. They got the factory, the maker, and the\n"
" distribution. They're like a whole goddamn airline they got so much Jet."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:636
msgid "Yeah, what about it?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:637
msgid "What factory?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:638
msgid "What \"maker?\""
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:639
msgid "How extensive is their distribution network?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:650
msgid ""
"Got factories all over New Reno, cranking out the shit day and night. That's why you can buy all\n"
" the Jet you need most anywhere: bars, casinos, on th' street... and a-course, from ME."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:652
msgid "Back to the Mordinos and Jet..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:660
msgid ""
"Yeah... (Leans in.) ...see, the Mordinos got themselves a lil' gold mine by the name o' Myron. Hit the jackpot with him... see,\n"
" he MADE Jet."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:662
msgid "Enough about the Mordinos and the families for now. Tell me about this Myron..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:670
msgid ""
"They pump it all over New Reno, for starters. Up north to the Den, and also... uh... (Catches himself, then shrugs and continues.)\n"
" ... well, it's also makin' it's way to Redding nowadays, too, which don't hurt the Mordinos purse none."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:672 dialog/vcdwnbar.msg:198 dialog/vcdwnbar.msg:204
#: dialog/vcdwnbar.msg:210 dialog/vcdwnbar.msg:223
msgid "Tell me about Redding."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:685
msgid ""
"Not much TO say. Mining town northwest o' here. Word is, Mordino wants to get some influence there, get some of\n"
" that Redding GOLD they dig up. So he ships them Jet, they ship back gold, everybody happy."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:695
msgid ""
"Quiet bunch. They're led by Louis Salvatore, an original gangster gettin' on in years. Their territory's on the West Side;\n"
" their crib's this bar called Salvatore's on 2nd Street. Don't be making trouble there."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:710
msgid ""
"Some free advice: You see a Salvatore, keep your head down n' mouth shut, or they'll cut you in two. They got the best\n"
" firepower this side of Cee-Ay, so nobody with any kinda sense fucks with them, understand?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:711
msgid "What kind of \"firepower\" do the Salvatores have?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:712
msgid "Sounds like they got some pretty heavy shit. What are they packing?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:715
msgid "Interesting... thanks for the warning."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:725
msgid ""
"Pistols...'cept they shoot LIGHT. Now, Reno's a city o' lights, but the light THOSE pistols shine can cut a man in\n"
" two... *swuppp*... (Jules makes slicing motion.) Makes a clean burn 'tween the two halves, it does."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:726
msgid "They shoot light? Do they call the pistols 'laser pistols?'"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:727
msgid "I'll be sure to be careful, then. Can you tell me about the other families?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:735
msgid ""
"Well, uh, I don't really know... I ain't sure what you're talking about. But take my word for it: don't go asking\n"
" the Salvatores about those pistols. They have this twitchy habit a killing people who're curious."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:736
msgid ""
"By 'laser pistols,' Jules, I mean pistols that emit beams of coherent light. A beam of sufficient wattage - say, several\n"
" megawatts - could do considerable damage if focused on a target for a few seconds, producing the effect you've described."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:737
msgid "Did they always have these pistols?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:750
msgid ""
"They didn't always have 'em... else they'd be in charge o' New Reno... ALL of New Reno. As it stands, they're just\n"
" building up quietly. Those pistols showed up... maybe a few months back, 'round the time o' the massacre."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:751
msgid "Massacre?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:765
msgid ""
"Oh, yeah... two Salvatore boys with those pistols killed a buncha Bishop's men, then shot down some of Mordino's boys who'd\n"
" been tryin' to muscle in on the West Side. Since then, the other families steered clear of the Salvatores."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:766
msgid ""
"Definitely sounds like lasers. Do you know how the Salvatores power their laser pistols? Do they employ battery packs,\n"
" fusion cells, or cabled power systems of any kind?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:767
msgid "Any idea where they're getting these pistols from?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:780
msgid ""
"No idea, friend, I ain't asking, and you shouldn't neither... take my advice. You looking for weapons, there's\n"
" other... safer... places you can try."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:781
msgid "Like where?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:782
msgid "Tell me some more about the families."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:795
msgid ""
"Uh... now, I  don't know 'bout that, and... hmmmm. Y'know, you talk like one of them whitecoats over at the Stables. Y'sure you ain't\n"
" one of them?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:796
msgid "Stables?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:810
msgid ""
"(Leans in.) Now, I don't want to go on 'bout the less PLEASANT New Reno sites, but there's a buncha whitecoats\n"
" who talk like you in this building, the Stables, north o' town. Heavily guarded by Mordino's men."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:811
msgid "What do they do there?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:825
msgid ""
"Test new kinds o' Jet, from what I hear. Now, I'm telling you this in CONFIDENCE, friend: don't go poking around\n"
" there... the Mordinos don't like visitors. 'Sides... Jules can get you all the Jet you need."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:826
msgid "Why do the Mordinos keep testing Jet? It sounds like it's addictive enough as it is."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:827
msgid "Who do the Mordinos test the drugs on?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:828
msgid "Do you know how I can get into the Stables?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:840
msgid "Slaves, pretty much. Keep 'em in stalls in the stables, like brahmin. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:841
msgid "Mordinos buy a bunch from slavers that pass through. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:842
msgid "Mordinos buy a bunch from slavers like you that pass through New Reno. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:843
msgid "They buy a helluva lot, too, cause the slaves keep getting sick, running away... or die. Mostly die."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:860
msgid ""
"Just to make it better, I guess, refine the process, refine the drug. Jet's good, but if they can make it even\n"
" BETTER... difference between scraping the sky and flying to the moon, I s'pose."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:880
msgid ""
"Now hold on a minute -- I wouldn't even THINK about that if I were you, friend. The Mordinos guard that place like\n"
" rabid dogs. Just put the thought outta your mind."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:881
msgid "There must be a way in..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:886
msgid "All right, nevermind then. Thanks for the information."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:895
msgid ""
"Well... if you can talk all smart like you were doing, you could pass for one of the whitecoats there.\n"
" 'Course, you could also hire on with the Mordinos and get put there..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:910
msgid "Ha! John Bishop? Not much to say: Bishop's a smart one, tough, and he's looking to get it ALL."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:911
msgid "Yeah, well, he'll have to fight me for it. Where is this jerk-off's territory?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:912
msgid "Where's his territory?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:925
msgid ""
"He hangs out at the Shark Club up on 2nd Street. He's surrounded by guards, so don't go paying a visit unless you got REAL\n"
" business with him. (Smiles evily.) And keep yer business away from his wife. AND his daughter."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:926
msgid "Uh, business?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:927
msgid "No danger of that."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:935
msgid ""
"You know what I mean, brother. Just stay away from them two, 'less the thought of bein' on Bishop's list is somethin'\n"
" you like."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:936
msgid "Well, maybe so, but WHAT you got 'tween your legs don't matter... to Missus Bishop, at least. She swings like a saloon door."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:937
msgid "Uh, tell me some more about the families."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:945
msgid ""
"The Wrights? Heh. The Wrights are the only family who ARE family. The other families, see, they got mercs\n"
" and tumbleweeds for muscle, but the Wright family IS the Wright family, understand?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:946
msgid "Got a warning for you where the Wrights are concerned, slaver... see, the Wrights are the only family who ARE family."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:947
msgid "They're family? How many are there?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:960
msgid "Almost twenty or more true-blooded Wrights. Mean as spit and each of them uglier than the next."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:961
msgid ""
"Almost twenty or more true-blooded Wrights, and they don't take kindly to people in your line of work. Word is, they\n"
" lost a sister way back when to a slaver, and they ain't liked slavers ever since."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:962
msgid "What do the Wrights control in New Reno?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:975
msgid ""
"They ain't got no casino, they mostly deal in alcohol and sell it to the other families. So if you're looking\n"
" for hootch... they hang out in the east side o' town in a big mansion."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:985
msgid "Brother, you need look no farther than humble Jules himself. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:986
msgid "Sister, you need look no farther than humble Jules himself. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:987
msgid "My sweet sister, you need look no farther than humble Jules himself. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:988
msgid "I got it ALL, and if I ain't got it, you don't want it. Shall we get down to bizness?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:989
msgid "Sure. Let's deal."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:990
msgid "What kind of drugs can I get in New Reno?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:991 dialog/ncpitbos.msg:427 dialog/vcdrtroy.msg:126
msgid "Not right now. I had some other questions..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:992
msgid "Actually, I'm not interested in any drugs right now. I have to be going."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1005
msgid ""
"All KINDS o' shit. I got shit make you horny, make your woman horny, make you hard, make you happy, make you strong,\n"
" make you smart... and, o course, I got THE drug, the shit that'll let you FLY... Jet."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1006
msgid ""
"All KINDS o' shit. I got shit make you horny, make you wet, dry you out, calm you down, sex you up, make you happy,\n"
" make you strong, make you smart... and, o course, I got THE shit that'll let you FLY... Jet."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1008
msgid "Where does Jet come from? Has it always been around?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1025
msgid ""
"Well... uh... Jet comes from here... Reno, I mean. It ain't been around long, but it's in DEMAND, know what I'm saying? (Winks.)\n"
" Number one reason we get tourists like yourself."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1026
msgid "Well, I'm looking to buy some drugs. Let's deal."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1027
msgid "But why did Jet come from here?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1035
msgid ""
"Aw, now... see, Family Mordino struck the jackpot one day when they found this little brainiac called Myron. Seems he's a\n"
" natural when it comes to making drugs. He MADE Jet."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1036
msgid "Myron, huh? Where can I find him?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1045
msgid ""
"(Leans in.) Now, I don't want to go on 'bout the less PLEASANT New Reno sites, but there's this building, the Stables,\n"
" north o' town. Heavily guarded by the Mordino family. That's where Myron is."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1046
msgid "Stables outside of town?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1055
msgid ""
"Yeah, Mordinos keep ol' golden boy there, give him chips, whores, anything he wants, as long as he makes drugs. Jet\n"
" was his FINEST. Ain't seen anything so addictive in a long time. Turned Reno around, it did."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1065
msgid "(Jules stops and studies you, his eyes running up and down your body.)"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1066
msgid "Jules? Hello? I asked if there was any way I could meet Myron."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1075
msgid ""
"Whoa, now, brother, here's some free advice: don't you go be looking to meet Myron, 'cause the Mordinos catch wind of THAT, they'll gut you and let\n"
" you die on Golgotha."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1076
msgid ""
"I wouldn't be trying it. If you need Jet, don't go see Myron, cause you can get it from me. Mordinos catch wind of you\n"
" seeing Myron, they'll gut you and let you die on Golgotha."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1077
msgid ""
"Well, now... YOU might be able to see him. Thing is, the Mordinos catch wind of it, they'll gut you and let you die on\n"
" Golgotha."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1078
msgid "Isn't there any way I could see him?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1079
msgid "Why would I be able to see him?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1080 dialog/ncjules.msg:1103
msgid "Why were you studying me like a sculpture a second ago?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1081
msgid "Golgotha? What's that?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1083 dialog/ncpitbos.msg:377 dialog/ncpitbos.msg:407
#: dialog/ncpitbos.msg:417
msgid "Interesting. Thanks for the information."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1101
msgid "Isn't there any way I could see Myron?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1102
msgid "Why would I be able to see Myron?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1115
msgid ""
"I was doing THAT cause I was seein' if you were Myron's type, but you don't look it. Maybe if you cleaned yourself up\n"
" some, Myron'd give you a second glance... see, he likes the womenses. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1116
msgid "(Leers.) Cause, honey, you look GOOD. And Myron likes women that look GOOD. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1117
msgid "Boy's like a rabbit, and is ALWAYS looking for a new cabbage patch."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1118
msgid "What was that about Golgotha?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1119
msgid "Uh, great. Thanks for the tip, Jules. Say, I had some other questions..."
