#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1166
msgid "I'll keep that in mind. Say, I had some more questions..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1167
msgid "His drugs aren't safe, huh? Well, thanks for the tip, I think I better be going."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1175
msgid ""
"I hear you, brother. Most TOURISTS, see, they stride down Virgin street and get suckered by some two-chip whore.\n"
" You look like you got class, so head over to the Cat's Paw 'cross the street there. Tell 'em Jules sent you."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1176
msgid ""
"I hear you, sister. Most TOURISTS, see, they stride down Virgin street and get suckered by some glitterboy.\n"
" You look like you got class, so head over to the Cat's Paw 'cross the street there. Tell 'em Jules sent you."
