#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1177
msgid "(Smiles, holds out arms.) Look no farther, my sweet sister. Jules is at your command!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1178
msgid "Uh, thanks, Jules, but no. Say, I had some more questions..."
