#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1211
msgid "Could be. I had some other questions..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1220
msgid "A what?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1221 dialog/ncliljes.msg:1077 dialog/nhmyron.msg:1623
#: dialog/vcstark.msg:174 dialog/vcstark.msg:180 dialog/vcstark.msg:185
#: dialog/vcstark.msg:306 dialog/vcstark.msg:337
msgid "Forget it. I had some other questions..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1230
msgid ""
"Uh... Wright kid? Yeah, I heard about that. A damn shame. Kids his age shouldn't be doing drugs. They got so much\n"
" to live for without being given impure shit."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1231
msgid "Speaking of impure shit, Renesco said you sell Jet laced with arsenic."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1232
msgid "What do you mean, \"impure shit?\""
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1233
msgid "You know anything about this empty Jet canister?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1234
msgid "Interesting you should say that... I don't think he overdosed on Jet. I think he was poisoned."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1250
msgid ""
"(Shrugs.) Some dealers don't care what they sell, and people die. Now I ain't saying nothing, but I'd check with ol'\n"
" Renesco the Rocketman and see how good his shit is."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1251
msgid "I did check with Renesco... he said you sell Jet laced with arsenic."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1252
msgid "Reno's a big place, Jules. Anybody else who might be responsible?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1254
msgid "All right. I'll check him out."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1270
msgid ""
"Lotta dealers in town... Lil' Jesus Mordino, maybe, but why he would sell to a Wright don't make sense. There's Jagged\n"
" Jimmy J up on 2nd Street, north of here, but he's small time. I'd still check with Renesco, though."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1272
msgid "\"Jagged Jimmy J?\" Who's that?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1273
msgid "Lil' Jesus Mordino? Where can I find him?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1274
msgid "Maybe I will. Say, I had some other questions..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1275
msgid "Lil' Jesus... Jagged Jimmy J... Renesco. Got it. Thanks."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1290
msgid ""
"(Jules' smile dies.) I'm lookin' for people like you comin' into Reno. This is the prime spot to deal. Plus, certain\n"
" establishments pay me to point newcomers their way. THAT a good enough answer for you?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1291
msgid "Yes. Now I need the answer to some other questions..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1292
msgid "Just curious. Thanks for the honesty."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1305
msgid "Your CAR? You sure you parked it here? I ain't seen it."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1306
msgid ""
"What, you suddenly gone BLIND? You see my FIST, mother fucker? You SEE it?!! Now tell me again you haven't seen my\n"
" car... I fucking DARE you."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1307
msgid ""
"Jules, if you don't tell me what happened to my car, I'll tell Family Wright YOU sold their son the Jet that\n"
" killed him. You'll be dead within the hour. Talk."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1308
msgid "You SURE you haven't seen it, Jules?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1309
msgid "Yes, I'm SURE I parked it here. Any idea where it might be?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1311
msgid "I better go look for it."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1320
msgid "Naw, brother, I ain't seen it. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1321
msgid "Naw, sister, I ain't seen it. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1322
msgid "I'll keep an eye out for it, though. (Shrugs.) Still, Reno's a big place..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1323
msgid ""
"Jules, I have this crazy HUNCH you know where my car went. If you don't tell me where it is, I'll use you for\n"
" target practice. Now talk."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1324
msgid "Thanks anyway. I had some other questions..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1340
msgid "Sister, I don't know NOTHING about your car. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1341
msgid "Brother, I don't know NOTHING about your car. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1342
msgid "I AIN'T seen what happened to it, and I DON'T know where it is. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1343
msgid "(He throws a hateful glance at Cody across the street.)"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1344
msgid "Really? That sounds like a load of SHIT to me."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1345
msgid "That so? I KNOW you did something with it, so you better tell me where it is before I do something to YOU."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1346
msgid "Nevermind then. I'll keep looking for it."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1360
msgid "All right, brother, all right! "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1361
msgid "All right, sister, all right! "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1362
msgid "...I seen some guys take the car not long ago. But there were too many of them for me to stop, y'know, and --"
