msgid ""
"H... hey. Hey, welcome back! (Smiles uneasily. His cologne slams into you like a wave.) What you need from Jules, my\n"
" friend, huh? A..anything?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1390
msgid "Nice cologne, Jules. I smelled it all over Cody's body. You're dead."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1391
msgid "Cody's dead, Jules. I'm betting you were responsible. You're dead."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1405
