#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1486
msgid "And \"Jagged Jimmy J?\" Where can I find him?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1487
msgid "All right... say, I had some other questions..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncjules.msg:1500
msgid ""
"You tell that bitch he keeps talking shit like that, an' I'LL kill 'im before old man Wright does. You know what kind\n"
" of talk that is? That's talk from a man who's SCARED, that's what it is."
