#: dialog/ncorvill.msg:681
msgid ""
"Way I see it, the Mordinos control the Jet in Reno. Naturally, you'd blame them for a drug overdose... and then there'd\n"
" be war. IF you two didn't wipe each other out, you'd at least be weakened by the fight. That makes life easier for the\n"
" Salvatores... all they have to worry about then is the Bishops."
