msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:270
msgid "Me? Oh, I'm just jolly Saint Nick, you cranially challenged half-wit."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:271
msgid ""
"Me? I'm jolly Saint Nick. And YOU must be that stupid thug-for-hire that's been roaming around town like a\n"
" starved dog hungry for its own excrement."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:272
msgid ""
"Me? I'm jolly ol' Saint Nick. And YOU must be that stupid piece of tailchasing porno trash that's hung like\n"
" a horse and as stupid as one."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:273
msgid ""
"Me? I'm jolly ol' Saint Nick. And YOU must be that stupid slip of porno trash that trench coat-wearing elderly\n"
" men use to fulfill their masturbatory fantasies."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:274
msgid "Well, I'm glad I don't have to introduce myself then. What do you do here, \"Nick?\""
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:275
msgid "Saint Nick? Who the hell is that?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:276
msgid "Look grandpa, one more comment like that, and I'll be wearing your teeth as a necklace."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:277
msgid "Look, I'm going to let your comment slide... this time. Now, who are you?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:278
msgid "Impressive vocabulary...\"Nick.\" You from around here?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:279
msgid "Forget this. I'm out of here."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:290
msgid ""
"(Glares at you, then snorts.) Name's Renesco. Just tell me what it is you want, you... well, whatever it is you are.\n"
" (Squints at you.) You look like one of those sun-worshipping primates under all that get-up."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:291
msgid "I'm from a village to the northwest. Arroyo."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:292
msgid "What do you sell here?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:293
msgid ""
"What do I WANT? I don't really know. Most of the time I ignore my quest and walk into the homes of others,\n"
" riffling through people's shelves... oooh, like those over there!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:294
msgid "You have an interesting vocabulary... Renesco. Are you from around here?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:305
msgid ""
"I sell recreational drugs mostly. That's why they gave me that idiotic appellation, 'the Rocketman.' Hmmmph. I\n"
" also sell some caravan supplies. You NEED anything or can I get back to something important?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:306
msgid ""
"Rocketman, huh? Know the line in that Elton John song, \"Rocketman, burning off the mmmncfnfm there at home?' What's\n"
" he really saying there?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:307 dialog/vcdarrow.msg:128 dialog/vcdarrow.msg:142
#: dialog/vcfarrel.msg:128 dialog/vcfarrel.msg:142
msgid "Can I see what you have in stock?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:308
msgid "You sell drugs here in the STORE?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:309
msgid "You mean like selling drugs to Wright's son?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:310
msgid "Go on back to what you were doing."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:320
msgid "(Renesco glares at you. It looks like he is undressing you mentally, then tearing you limb from limb.)"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:321
msgid "Nevermind, then. I had some other questions..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:330
msgid ""
"(Renesco looks at you in disgust.) Yes. In the STORE. This isn't the 20th century where drugs are sold by\n"
" street corner cockroaches who live in constant fear of the authorities."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:331
msgid "Well, then -"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:332
msgid "But -"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:333
msgid "Uh, I think I better -"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:350
msgid ""
"This is NEW RENO. There are no cops, no law, and there's plenty of customers who don't mind buying poison at the\n"
" pharmacy down the street. Does THAT answer your question, primate?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:351
msgid "All except one: Was Richard Wright one of your customers?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:352
msgid "All right, all right... what have you got in stock?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:353
msgid "Actually, I had some more questions..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:354
msgid "But, like you said, the drugs are... poisonous. They kill the spirit. Doesn't it bother you to sell them?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:355
msgid "Sure does. I'll be going now."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:365
msgid ""
"Does it BOTHER me to sell them to idiots, slavers, crime lords and tribals that the world would be better off\n"
" without? Primate, three words: get out more."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:366
msgid "OK... can I see what you have in stock?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:367
msgid "All right, all right. Look, I had some other questions..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:368
msgid "The drugs here in New Reno are finding their way to other places, and hurting people there. Doesn't that concern you?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:369
msgid "I'll start by leaving right now."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:375
msgid "So? What do I care about them?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:377
msgid ""
"The human race suffered a horrible tragedy. Now we are trying to rebuild. Selling Jet seems... counterproductive\n"
" to that reconstruction."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:378
msgid "Well, whatever. I must be going now."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:385
msgid ""
"So. What. No one is FORCING those idiots to inhale Jet. No one's going around and jamming it down their\n"
" throats!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:386
msgid "Can I see -"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:387
msgid "But don't -"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:388
msgid "That is your -"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:395
msgid ""
"Those lamphead rock humpers in Redding KNOW what they're taking, so I don't feel a millimeter of pity for 'em!\n"
" Far as I'm concerned, Jet weeds out the human trash that shoulda died when the bombs dropped!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:396
msgid "Uh, okay. Can I see your stock?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:397
msgid "Where is this Redding you speak of? Why do you mention them?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:398
msgid "You mentioned Redding specifically. Why is Jet so prevalent in Redding?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:400
msgid "That is your right to feel that way. I must be going now."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:410
msgid ""
"Well, Redding's a... special case. See, there's people in Reno who make sure Redding's well-supplied. After all, you\n"
" taste Jet once, you're hooked. It's how I make MY living."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:411
msgid "Speaking of which, can I see your stock?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:412
msgid "Who is making sure Redding is well-supplied? And why?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:413
msgid "So I noticed. Look, I had some other questions..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:414
msgid "I see... I must be going now."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:420
msgid ""
"Well, tribal, I doubt you have the sense to notice this yet, but New Reno doesn't produce anything useful.\n"
" It's like a big, brightly-lit prairie tick sitting out in the desert. Now, Redding, on the other hand..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:422
msgid "...DOES produce something useful."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:430
msgid ""
"First and last time I'm gonna warn you, tribal: Don't finish my goddamn sentences. I don't like smartass primates\n"
" that talk when they should listen. No wonder you all still use spears..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:431
msgid "Not all of us. For example, I use a variety of weapons to kill people... let me show you."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:432
msgid "Forgive me. Please go on."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:433
msgid "Burn in hell. I'm outta here. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:440
msgid ""
"Redding has a stable work force that mines raw materials, mostly gold. New Reno sure could use that gold. Somebody\n"
" figures all we gotta do is get those miners addicted, and we got 'em for life. You understand now?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:441
msgid "Yes... except for one thing: Where did Jet come from?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:442
msgid "Who's trying to addict all the miners?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:443
msgid "Yeah, I understand. Look, I had some other questions..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:444
msgid "I don't want to hear anymore. I must be going now."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:450
msgid ""
"(Points at Myron.) Why don't you ask your little horny toad friend there? I'm sure he'd be happy to tell you. (Glares\n"
" at Myron.) Right, kid?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:451
msgid ""
"We have one person to thank for Jet. You heard of Family Mordino's little golden boy, Myron? Well, the little\n"
" bastard CREATED Jet. Big Jesus Mordino just let everyone know where they could get it."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:452
msgid "Tell me more about Myron."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:453 dialog/nhmyron.msg:1619
msgid "Is there any cure for Jet?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:460
msgid ""
"Big Jesus Mordino's funneling Jet into Redding. Typical power play. Once the pipeline really gets going, those\n"
" miners are goners."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:461
msgid "Where did Jet come from?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:470
msgid ""
"Horny as a toad and all the morals of one. Smart kid, though. High IQ. Wasting his brains manufacturing drugs, that's\n"
" for damn certain."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:480
msgid "The Mordinos' got him locked up somewhere. Heavily-guarded, probably. Don't know exactly where."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:481
msgid "Thanks for the information. Can I see what you have in stock?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:490
msgid ""
"A CURE for methamphetamine addiction?! Ha! I only know two: one is death. The other is locking yourself\n"
" in a cage for a year without Jet and sweat it out of your system. Hmmmph. \"Cure,\" my ass! What nonsense!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:492
msgid "There must be a cure. What's Jet's chemical composition?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:505
msgid "Why don't you ask your friend there? He designed the drug."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:506
msgid "I just sell the stuff. I'd ask a scientist. Or Myron. He designed the drug."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:515
msgid "(Renesco glares at you in silence.)"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:516
msgid "(Renesco glares at you again, this time in silence.)"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:517
msgid ""
"I think you'd like Arroyo. It's a peaceful village. Except for the plants possessed by evil spirits... and of course, the temple\n"
" of trials filled with those deadly spear traps and the man-eating giant ants."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:518
msgid "Hey, you ever heard of a Garden of Eden Creation Kit? Or Vault 13?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:519
msgid "Okay, then... I'm out of here."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:525
msgid "(Renesco continues to glare at you.)"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:526
msgid ""
"And sometimes the elder gets upset at little things, like... heh-heh... that one night when I ignored my vow of\n"
" celibacy and snuck out with Reyna - Whose - Legs - Crush - With - Strength - of - Thousand - Snakes to the Arroyo canyon..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:535
msgid "(Renesco gives you a withering stare.)"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:536
msgid ""
"It was like yesterday. Reyna's body glowed like silver in the moonlight when she knelt down and... hey, you know what?\n"
" You might like the elder. She's about your age."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:545
msgid "(Renesco continues to glare at you as if he could somehow make you disappear just by imagining it hard enough.)"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:546
msgid ""
"Did I mention Arroyo was founded by my ancestor, the holy Vault Dweller? He made a legendary journey from the\n"
" south after defeating a great evil. (Puff up chest and stare proudly into the distance.) Now, *I* am the deliverer of my\n"
" tribe, chosen to search for the holy GECK!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:547
msgid "Okay, then, enough stories... I better be on my way. Praise the Vault!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:555
msgid "(Renesco's glare crumbles.) "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:556
msgid ""
"GECK? As in 'Garden of Eden Creation Kit?' Comes with a basic replicator unit, holodisc reader with selections\n"
" from the library of congress, and a little pen flashlight?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:557
msgid "Yes, but that's not important right now. I haven't finished telling you about Arroyo."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:558
msgid "Yes! My village is having trouble with crops, and the GECK is needed to restore them. Do you know where I can find one?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:559
msgid "It is said to be sealed within Vault 13, or so the legends say. Do you know of such a place?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:560
msgid "If you're not going to LISTEN when I recite the holy scriptures, I'm out of here."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:561
msgid "Could be. Look, I have to go."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:570
msgid ""
"Your backwater herb-smoking village be damned, and you along with it. Why is\n"
" a primate like you looking for a GECK?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:571
msgid ""
"Arroyo... my backwater herb-smoking village, as you say... is having trouble with its crops. The GECK is needed\n"
" to restore them."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:572
msgid "It is said to be sealed within Vault 13. Do you know of such a place?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:573
msgid "I don't think I feel like sharing that at the moment. Goodbye."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:580
msgid ""
"Hmmmmm. It sure could do that... easy. IF you could find one. Don't even know where you'd start looking. NCR\n"
" or Vault City, maybe, but I doubt they'd have one... still..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:581 dialog/nhmyron.msg:756
msgid "Still...?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:590
msgid "Still, those self-righteous bastards might be able to point you in a direction. If they speak slowly and use small words..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:591
msgid "NCR or Vault City you say? I will go in search of these places and ask their villagers about the GECK. Thank you."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:592
msgid "Why would the GECK not be in sacred Vault 13? The scriptures SAY that the GECK is sealed within the sacred Vault 13."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:593
msgid "Very funny. I had some other questions..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:594
msgid "Okay, then... I'll go check it out. Thanks."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:600
msgid ""
"Hell no, primate. I've heard of vaults, sure, but not Vault 13. Closest thing is Vault City to the northeast... and\n"
" if those aristocratic jackanapes inhabited a Vault once, they sure as hell don't live there no more."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:601
msgid ""
"Vault City, you say? I will go in search of this Vault city and ask their villagers about the GECK.\n"
" Thank you, Renesco. Praise the Vault! "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:602
msgid "\"Vaults?\" There is more than one Vault?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:610
msgid ""
"If you're going to Vault City, don't thank me, primate. You're better off in New Reno. At least the people\n"
" sizing you up for a coffin are honest about it."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:611
msgid "Okay, then... I'm on my way to Vault City. Praise the Vault! "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:612
msgid "I see. Thanks for the warning. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:620
msgid ""
"Why do you think it's called Vault THIRTEEN, spearchucker? What, was your tribe short on brains or do you just\n"
" perform ritual lobotomies to cleanse the tiny voice of reason that speaks in your head?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:623
msgid "Yeah, there you go sugar-talking me again. Thanks... for the info, at least. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:630
msgid "A person's past ain't a smart topic of conversation here in New Reno. Now, what is you want?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:632
msgid "You sound like an educated man. Have you ever heard of a GECK or a place called Vault 13?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:634
msgid "Nothing, nevermind."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:640
msgid ""
"(Renesco snatches the glasses from you and puts them on. His eyes widen.) Sweet Reno! THAT'S what this damn\n"
" shop looks like. (Frowns.) What a mess... and what is that on the shelves? Looks like brahmin shit."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:641
msgid "You're welcome..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:642
msgid "Enjoy."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:650
msgid "Hmpphh! I... hmmm... uh... where did you get these?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:651 dialog/ncrenesc.msg:661
msgid ""
"Well, there was this tiny radscorpion, see, and there was this scientist that was training him, and... you know what? Even I\n"
" don't believe it. Just keep them, all right?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:652
msgid "Let's just say I found them. Somewhere."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:660
msgid "Hey! Waitaminute! Where did you get these?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:670
msgid ""
"Well, I... hmnnn... I'm... eh, grateful. I thought I was going to have to suffer with those broken frames for the\n"
" rest of my life. If I can do something for you, you let me know... and, uh, I'll THINK about it."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:671
msgid "How about a discount?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:672
msgid "Nevermind... look, just wear them in good health, okay? I had some other questions..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:673
msgid ""
"Someday - and that day may never come - I'll call upon you to do a service for me. But until that day\n"
" accept these glasses as a gift on my daughter's wedding day. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:680
msgid "Ehhh..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:681
msgid "Errr..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:683
msgid "Okay! Okay! I'll give you a discount! Hmphhh."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:684
msgid "C'mon. Just a little discount. C'mon..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:687
msgid "Great! Let's see what you've got, \"buddy.\""
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:688
msgid "Excellent! Say, I had some other questions..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:689
msgid "I'll be back to shop later. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:701
msgid "Look, I'm a busy man..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:702
msgid "Well? Out with it already!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:704
msgid "Did I ever tell you about my village Arroyo?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:706
msgid "Did you sell Jet to Richard Wright?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:707
msgid "I've come to collect Mr. Salvatore's tribute."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:710
msgid "I'm looking for some mine parts for Broken Hills..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:711
msgid "You have an interesting vocabulary... are you from around here?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:712
msgid "Nevermind. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:725
msgid "(Eyes narrow.) So?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:726
msgid "Well, I need the parts to fix the air purifier in their mine. I was told you could help me."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:727
msgid "Well, I need the parts to fix the air purifier in their mine. Zaius sent me. He said, uh... said... uh... shit."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:728
msgid "Well, I need the parts to fix the air purifier in their mine. Zaius sent me. He said, 'The canary's kicked the bucket.'"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:735
msgid "Yes, I do happen to have some parts that could fix the air purifier. 100 bucks."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:736
msgid "I'll take it. Here you go."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:737
msgid "How about fifty bucks?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:738
msgid "Uh, I don't have a hundred on me... I'll be back later with the cash. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:745
msgid "Inflation due to managerial irritation with hagglers. 200 or nothing."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:746
msgid "(Frowns.) 200 or nothing."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:747
msgid "Two hundred?! You said a HUNDRED a second ago!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:748
msgid "Uh, I'll take it. Here you go."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:749
msgid "Uh, I don't have two hundred on me... I'll be back later with the cash. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:755
msgid "I STRONGLY doubt that is what he said. It wasn't 'The canary's kicked the bucket,' was it?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:756 dialog/vcmainwk.msg:324
msgid "Well, yes."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:761
msgid "\"And?\""
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:765
msgid "And the SECOND part was...?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:766
msgid "\"Second part?\" He didn't say anything about a SECOND part. That low-down bast -!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:769
msgid "Just testing you. There is no second part. Well, if Zaius sent you, I SUPPOSE I have some parts to spare. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:770
msgid "Here you go. Don't drop them."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:771 dialog/vcbarkus.msg:203 dialog/vclynett.msg:315
#: dialog/vclynett.msg:693 dialog/vclynett.msg:724 dialog/vclynett.msg:735
msgid "Thanks. I had some other questions..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:772
msgid "Uh, thanks. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:780
msgid ""
"Don't you even TRY and pin that accusation on me. You want to know who did it, ask Tweedledum and Tweedledumber\n"
" if they're still selling Jet laced with arsenic."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:781
msgid "'Tweedledum' and 'Tweedledumber?' Who are they?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:782
msgid "Jules said to ask you. He says you sell bad shit."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:783
msgid "Jagged Jimmy said to ask you. He says you sell bad shit."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:784
msgid "They both said to ask YOU about it. They say you sell bad shit."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:785
msgid "I don't think it was arsenic... I DO think he was poisoned, though."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:786
msgid "Can you tell me anything about this empty Jet canister?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:788
msgid "I'll go ask them then. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:795
msgid ""
"That vulture Jules and that lying reprobate 'Jagged Jimmy.' Jules is always perched near the entrance\n"
" to town looking for ignorant visitors to victimize, and Jagged Jimmy deals on 2nd Street to the rest of the Reno cattle."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:798
msgid "They said to ask you. They say you sell bad shit. Shit that kills people."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:800
msgid "I'll go talk to them then. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:805
msgid "Look, primate... you don't even KNOW what you're babbling about."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:806
msgid "Oh, I think I -"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:807
msgid "Yeah? Well then, why don't -"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:808
msgid "Nevermind. I had some other qu -"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:809
msgid "Look I better be go -"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:815
msgid ""
"OPEN your mouth again and even a WHISPER, even a HINT, reaches Mr. Wright that I... or you... might've had anything\n"
" to do that boy's OD, our lives ain't worth Brahmin shit. If THAT happens --"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:816
msgid "Oh? So you -"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:817
msgid "Me?! Now hold on just a -"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:825
msgid ""
"If THAT happens, you tribal SHIT, I SWEAR you'll die before I do. Now... for the LAST time, that kid never bought SHIT\n"
" from me, understand? Don't you EVER say his name in here again, or so help me..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:826
msgid ""
"JULES says he didn't sell to the kid. JIMMY says he didn't sell to the kid. YOU say you didn't sell to him. One\n"
" of you is lying."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:827
msgid ""
"JULES says he didn't sell to the kid. JIMMY says he didn't sell to the kid. YOU say you didn't sell to him. Either\n"
" you all are lying, or... somebody else is responsible."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:828
msgid "Can you tell me anything else about Richard Wright? Who did he hang around who might have used drugs?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:829
msgid "All right... look, I had some other questions..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:830
msgid "Okay, okay... I'm going now. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:835
msgid ""
"I can answer that easy. One of those two mongrels is lying to save their behind. Between the two, they\n"
" sell 90% of the Jet in Reno, and that's the only place the 'boy' we're talking about could've gotten it from."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:836
msgid ""
"Or somebody that bought from one of you three. Who were your customers last month who might have had contact\n"
" with... the victim?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:837
msgid "Can you tell me anything else about Richard Wright? Did he hang around anyone else who might have used drugs?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:838
msgid "I see... I had some other questions..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:839
msgid "I'm going now. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:845
msgid "You STUPID bastard. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:846
msgid "You STUPID bitch. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:847
msgid ""
"I TOLD you not to say his name in here. Get out! I see you again, I'll SHOOT YOU DEAD. If Mr. Wright comes looking\n"
" for me, thinks I killed his boy, YOU'LL die first."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:848
msgid "Don't threaten me, old man..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:849
msgid "Whoa. I'm going now. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:855
msgid ""
"I have NO idea. I didn't know the boy, so I don't know his friends OR his habits. The only one who could tell\n"
" you for sure is too busy being dead in Golgotha to tell you."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:858
msgid "Maybe I'll do that. Goodbye. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:865
msgid ""
"Then you wasted a trip. I PAID Mr. Salvatore his 'tribute' *two weeks ago,* as per the schedule. I don't know\n"
" who you are, or what you think you're doing, but you aren't getting one red chip from me. Get."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:866
msgid "Look, gramps. Stop giving me a hard time. Cough up the chips, or you'll be coughing up blood."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:867
msgid "I am Mr. Salvatore's representative. You will give me the tribute I have asked for, and you will do so now."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:868
msgid "I'll check with Mr. Salvatore about the schedule, then I'll be back. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:875
msgid "You lose your hearing, boy? "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:876
msgid "You lose your hearing, girl? "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:877
msgid "I SAID I. PAID. THE. TRIBUTE. ALREADY. *Two weeks ago.* If you were really from Salvatore, you would know that. Now git!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:878
msgid "Look. Last time: Hand over the chips."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:879
msgid "You are the one who has lost your hearing. I am Mr. Salvatore's representative, and you will pay the tribute."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:880
msgid "I warned you, gramps. Looks like we'll be doing this the hard way. Time to die."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:881
msgid "I'll check with Mr. Salvatore about the tribute, then I'll be back. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:890
msgid "Prove you're from Salvatore, and I'll CONSIDER giving you the chips. Else, you aren't getting shit."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:891
msgid "I do not need to prove myself. I am his representative, and that is all you need to know."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:892
msgid "What, you think this laser pistol is just for show?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:893
msgid "If you do not give me the tribute in five seconds, I WILL kill you."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:900
msgid "Get the hell out of here, you penny-ante thug! You so much as show your face in here again, and I'll shoot you myself!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:901
msgid "I warned you. Time to die."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:910
msgid "Hmmmph. Don't matter, I can't pay. The last collection nearly wiped me out."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:911
msgid "That is not my concern. You will get me the money now. Mr. Salvatore does not want to hear your excuses."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:920
msgid ""
"Threatening me ain't gonna help. Mr. Salvatore wants his money. I don't have it. He'll be mad at me, but he'll\n"
" be mad at you, too. Salvatore doesn't LIKE people who let him down... you better figure out something quick."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:921
msgid "I already have. I will pay your share for this period. In exchange, you will give me a discount at your store."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:924
msgid "I'll try and figure something out... I'll be back."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:930
msgid "Now hold on, you Neanderthal..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:931
msgid "I will not argue with you anymore. My patience is at an end. Those are my terms."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:940
msgid "I... look, now, I... hmmmm... all right, then. You get a...\"discount.\""
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:941
msgid "Let me see your stock. I will make my 'purchases' now."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:943
msgid "I don't want anything now, but don't worry, I'll be back. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:950
msgid ""
"(Folds arms.) Adequate. If you are expecting some handout for being a Good Samaritan, you are GRAVELY\n"
" mistaken. Now... what do you want?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:951
msgid ""
"Goddamn whatever deathclaw or marketing director spawned you! You WANT something?! Here! HERE! Take THIS!\n"
" Take ALL I have! Anything to get you to LEAVE ME ALONE!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:952
msgid "Let me see your stock."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:955
msgid "What the hell IS this...? "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:960
msgid "Poisoned? What are you babbling about?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:961
msgid ""
"The body's condition was consistent with Radscorpion poisoning. I think he died because his Jet was poisoned,\n"
" NOT because of an overdose."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:962
msgid "I found an empty Jet canister in his room. It had traces of Radscorpion venom in it."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:964
msgid "Forget it. I have to be going now. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:970
msgid "Radscorpion...? (Renesco suddenly freezes, as if remembering something.)"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:971
msgid "You son of a bitch. You *poisoned* the kid, didn't you?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:972
msgid "You know something about it, don't you?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:980
msgid "Whoa! Now wait just a minute...!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:981
msgid "Don't mess with me, Renesco! You try and weasel out of this one, and you'll be joining Richard. Understand?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:982
msgid "That's it. Me and Mr. Wright are going to have a little talk. Good day, Renesco... or should I say, \"goodbye.\""
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:990
msgid ""
"Wait a minute! Look... I didn't SELL it to the kid! He never bought ANYTHING from me! I... was ASKED\n"
" to make some Jet laced with radscorpion venom, but... but I DIDN'T sell it to the kid!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:991
msgid "You were ASKED to make poisoned Jet? For who?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:992
msgid "Who DID you sell it to?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:995
msgid ""
"The Salvatores requested it -- they said it was a...\"special order.\" I didn't know they were going to give\n"
" it to the Wright kid. You HAVE to believe me... I don't poison kids!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:996
msgid "Just adults, huh, Renesco? You sorry son of a bitch..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:997
msgid "WHY did you poison the Jet? You had to know they were going to kill someone with it."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:998
msgid "All right, all right, I believe you. I had some other questions..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:999
msgid "Just shut up. Look, I had some other questions..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:1000
msgid "The Salvatores, huh? I think Mr. Wright will want to know about this. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:1005
msgid ""
"The Salvatores OWN me, they OWN this place, and when they want something, I give it to them, or they'll kill\n"
" me and have me replaced. I never meant any harm to that boy."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:1007
msgid "Just shut up. Look, I had some other questions for you..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:1008
msgid "Yeah, I'm sure you had the best of intentions while you were spiking that Jet with poison. Goodbye, Renesco."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:1009
msgid "Later, Renesco. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:1020
msgid "It's empty. It's a Jet canister like the hundreds of others all over New Reno. Anything else I can help you with?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:1021
msgid "Does this belong to you?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:1022
msgid "Know anything about the radscorpion venom traces that are in this canister?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:1023
msgid "Yeah, I had some other questions..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:1030
msgid "No. Anything ELSE I can help you with?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:1033
msgid "No. Goodbye. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:1040
msgid "Golgotha? Mass graveyard outside of town to the south. Follow the stench... the one OTHER than your own."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:1042
msgid "You keep sweet-talking me like that, Renesco, and you'll be a long time dying. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:1043
msgid "THANKS, Renesco. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:1526
msgid ""
"And sometimes the elder gets upset at little things, like... heh-heh... that one night when I ignored my vow of\n"
" chastity and snuck out with Kor - Who - Thunders - Like - a - Thousand - Stallions to the Arroyo canyon..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:1536
msgid ""
"It was like yesterday. Kor's body rippled like bronze in the moonlight as I knelt down and... hey, you know what?\n"
" You might like the elder. She's about your age."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:2000
msgid "You have exposed Renesco's involvement in Richard Wright's death."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:5257
msgid " is so big. Me go now "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:5259
msgid " no shout WHY YOU KEEP SHOUTING BE STOPPING THE SHOUTING "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:5260
msgid ""
"...*sniff*...go get big brother to beat you up, old man! Then we'll have ice cream and...*sniff*...CAKE\n"
" and a big party with clowns and..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6000
msgid "I was looking for some pointers on heart health. Think you could fill me in on a thing or two?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6010
msgid "I know this must come as something of a shock to you, but a white smock does not automatically confer a cardiology degree. I am a pharmacist. I produce chems. Then you buy them. Then, you leave. Quietly."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6011
msgid "Fair enough. Moving on, then..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6012
msgid "C'mon, could you humor me? Just this once? Pretty pleeease?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6020
msgid "Fine. My prescription is cigarettes and red meat, in large quantities. Was that all? If I have to put up with much more vacuous prattle today, I'm liable to have a stroke myself."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6021
msgid "Yeah, you are pretty high strung, aren't you? I'll bet Hakunin could help you with that. He's the medicine man back home, in Arroyo. Say, have I ever told you about Arroyo?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6022
msgid "And wouldn't that be a tragedy. Next question..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6023
msgid "Okay then, just one more quick thing..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6024
msgid "Gee, thanks Renesco. I knew I could count on you. You take care now."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6030
msgid "I need you to fix me up with a special order."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6031
msgid "So, about that special order we were discussing..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6040
msgid "Yes? And? Were you expecting me to read your mind, or would you like me to surprise you?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6041
msgid "Not on your life, asshole. What I need are some... um... pills. For, um... (trail off, glance pointedly in the direction of your belt buckle, look Renesco in the eye, and clear your throat)."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6042
msgid "Not on your life, asshole. What I need are some... um... pills. For, um... a man's... (trail off, glance pointedly in the direction of your belt buckle, look Renesco in the eye, and clear your throat)."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6043
msgid "I'd like you to make me a batch of, erm, \"Corsican Brothers chewable multivitamins.\""
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6044
msgid "I'm looking for something you'd use to, uh, sharpen your spear, you know? Put a little bite back into your gecko?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6045
msgid "I'm looking for something a man would use to, uh, sharpen his spear, you know? Put a little bite back into his gecko?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6046
msgid "I'm looking for a complex PDE5-inhibitor compound, and I need the pills made according to my distinct specifications."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6050
msgid "What in Golgotha are you babbling about? English, Tribal! Do you speak it?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6051
msgid "(Sigh...) I would like you to make me some... erectile dysfunction medication."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6052
msgid "You know. Boner pills. Uh, for a friend."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6053
msgid "Boner pills. Not for me, obviously."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6054
msgid "You know exactly what I mean, you withered old bastard."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6060
msgid "(He leers derisively at you.) Hnn! I wouldn't exactly call that a \"special\" order. Half the reason this deviant cesspit of a city exists is to provide rutting degenerates such as yourself with an easy means of drowning in their own unsavory juices."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6061
msgid "I've got over a dozen brands here. Take your pick. And don't hurt yourself thinking too hard about it; they're all completely identical aside from the packaging."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6062
msgid "None of that is going to cut it. I need these made to order."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6063
msgid "That's a good start, but I had something specific in mind."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6070
msgid "(He sneers.) Oh, discerning customer, are you? Fine. Go on. It's been awhile since I got to charge anyone the specialty rate. Most of the local street vermin could care less what they're killing themselves with."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6071
msgid "Yeah, I hear that works out pretty well for you. Get those dollar signs out of your eyes, though, I'm not asking for anything too special. Just take some of that off the rack crap, grind it up, and shape it into smooth, circular, red pills, about yea big. Sound doable?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6072
msgid "(Show Renesco one of the heart pills.) What I need you to do is to make me a batch of those pills, only they need to look *exactly* like this one."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6073
msgid "Chemically, the base formulation can match the generic. As far as physical parameters... hmm... let's say, about a centimeter and a half in diameter, smooth, mildly rounded face, dull red coating. Lozenge edge of about an eighth-centimeter. Shouldn't be too much of a challenge for a man of your experience."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6080
msgid "Hmmm. Is that all? Remedial stuff, really. And the base materials are dirt cheap. Accounting for labor... $200 should suffice."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6081
msgid "What?! If I wanted to get screwed, I'd have gone to the Cat's Paw! At least I'd know what I was getting myself into."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6082
msgid "You know as well as I do that we're talking about $15 in chems and five minutes of mortar work. I think we need to talk some numbers here."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6083
msgid "All right. You've got overhead, I've got better places to be. $200."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6084
msgid "Not sure I can spare that much at the moment. Maybe we'll come back to this later."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6090
msgid "(His scowl deepens.) I'm not in the mood to beat around the bush with you. You think I'm going to buy that you're just some particularly picky homo not-so-erectus? PLEASE! Do you have any idea how long I've been doing this?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6091
msgid "You obviously haven't spent much time out of your cave, so take my word for it when I say there aren't too many kinds of pills going around that match that oddly specific description of yours, and one *very notable* one comes to mind immediately. \"Specialty\" items, specialty prices, throwback. Welcome to New Reno. That'll be $300."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6092
msgid "Look, I made sure no one even *breathed your name* in connection with that Wright affair. You do this for me, we're square. Okay?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6093
msgid "I covered your ass with Salvatore. Consider this collection on your debt."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6094
msgid "I don't think *Mr. Bishop* would be very happy with you if he knew you were hindering his interests like this, Renesco."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6095
msgid "Fine. $300, and that's for the pills *and* your discretion. Understand?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6096
msgid "Whoa, easy there fuzzy little man peach. Maybe I'll just come back when you're in a better mood."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6100
msgid "Well. I guess that concludes our business, then. I must say, tribal, this has been... almost *tolerable*. Now, sit on your hands and try not to ruin the moment. (Renesco takes your money and goes to work.)"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6101
msgid "(Minutes pass. Renesco dusts off his hands and rolls a pill bottle indistinguishable from Westin's across the counter at you.) There you are. Now, are we done here?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6103
msgid "That's it for me. See you around."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6110
msgid "(Renesco flushes, nostrils flaring in anger, but then looks down and begins cleaning his glasses very intently on his smock as he speaks.) Primate, the ONLY two things I will EVER be indebted to you for are JACK and SHIT."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6111
msgid "Now, that being the case... if it will disabuse you of this intolerable provincial delusion that you've somehow got something over me, the very THOUGHT of which makes me ill in ways I lack the words to describe... "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6112
