#: dialog/newr1.msg:1000
msgid ""
"Jules leads you into the wrecked city blocks surrounding New Reno. You don't think you could have found\n"
" this place on your own. Soon after you arrive, Jules vanishes."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newr1.msg:1100
msgid "The trail leads you into the wrecked city blocks surrounding New Reno."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newr1.msg:1200
msgid "You uncover a small metal cashbox. You wouldn't have found it if you weren't looking for it."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newr1.msg:1300
msgid ""
"Cody leads you into the wrecked city blocks surrounding New Reno, then runs back the way he came. You\n"
" don't think you could have found this place on your own."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newr1.msg:1400
msgid "You have defeated your first challenger."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newr1.msg:1401
msgid "You have defeated your second challenger."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newr1.msg:1402
msgid "You have defeated your third challenger."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newr1.msg:1403
msgid "You have defeated the Masticator!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newr1.msg:1404
msgid "You have become the Heavyweight Champion of New Reno."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newr1.msg:1405
msgid "You have defeated your last challenger!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newr1.msg:1500
msgid "You have convinced Mrs. Wright to destroy the stills."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newr1.msg:1550
msgid "You have witnessed the secret transaction."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newr1.msg:1600
msgid "In the heat of the fight, the Masticator tears your ear off."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newr1.msg:1700
msgid "Enraged, you tear the Masticator's ear off."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newrvb.msg:100
msgid "You have arrived on a desert plain outside of New Reno."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newrvb.msg:110
msgid "You see several crates filled with chemicals."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newrvb.msg:120
msgid ""
"You see several crates filled with chemicals. You can't identify the chemicals,\n"
" but they have been packed VERY carefully."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newrvb.msg:140
msgid ""
"You see a Vertibird... an advanced form of helicopter. Unfortunately, you have no\n"
" idea how to operate it."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newrvb.msg:150
msgid "You have no idea how to operate it."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newrvb.msg:200
msgid "(These guys give me the creeps...)"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newrvb.msg:201
msgid "(Shut up. Here they come.)"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newrvb.msg:202
msgid "*Zztttt* Do you have the cargo we requested? *Zzzttt*"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newrvb.msg:203
msgid "Yes, the chemicals are all here. You can check them if you like."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newrvb.msg:204
msgid "*Zztttt* That will not be necessary. *Zzzttt*"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newrvb.msg:205
msgid ""
"*Zztttt* You know what will happen if the chemicals do not meet the specifications\n"
" we requested. *Zzzttt*"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newrvb.msg:206
msgid "Right, of course. Uh, and you brought the lightbringers...?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newrvb.msg:207
msgid "*Zztttt* The laser weapons are in our cargo bay. *Zzzttt**"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newrvb.msg:208
msgid ""
"*Zztttt* To ensure your cooperation, we will transmit the arming sequence for them\n"
" once the chemicals are loaded. *Zzzttt*"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newrvb.msg:209
msgid "Uh... well... all right then. Load her up, boys --"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newrvb.msg:210
msgid "*Zztttt* No. *Zzzttt*"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newrvb.msg:211
msgid "*Zztttt* We will load the cargo. *Zzzttt*"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newrvb.msg:212
msgid "Uh, right... right. Of course. Give them room, boys."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newrvb.msg:213
msgid "All right; we're good here. The rest of you guards head back to Reno. We'll meet up with you."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newrvb.msg:250
msgid "Look! Someone's been watching us!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newrvb.msg:251
msgid "Kill them!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newrvb.msg:252
msgid "Looks like we got us a spy...!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newrvb.msg:253 dialog/newrvb.msg:352
msgid "*Zztttt* Mission aborted. Cargo failsafe sequence engaged. *Zzzttt*"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newrvb.msg:254 dialog/newrvb.msg:353
msgid "*Zztttt* Terminate hostiles, then return to base. *Zzzttt*"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newrvb.msg:300
msgid "Don't get near those armored fellas. They'll carve you up."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newrvb.msg:301
msgid "Get back in position."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newrvb.msg:302
msgid "Stop twitching... those armored guys don't like it much."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newrvb.msg:350
msgid "Dammit! What are you doing, dipshit?!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newrvb.msg:351
msgid "Get back to your post! What the hell are you do --?!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newrvb.msg:400
msgid "[Looks like there is a door. Open it and climb in?]"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newrvb.msg:403
msgid "Board the Vertibird."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newrvb.msg:404 dialog/oscomptr.msg:108 dialog/oscomptr.msg:113
#: dialog/oscomptr.msg:117 dialog/oscomptr.msg:120
msgid "Leave it alone."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newrvb.msg:450
msgid ""
"[Once you climb inside the cargo hold, the door seals behind you! You attempt to force it open, but it won't\n"
" budge. As you try to think of a way out, you hear the armored soldiers board the Vertibird, which then takes off with\n"
" you trapped inside!]"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newrvb.msg:451
msgid "Uh-oh"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newrvb.msg:500
msgid ""
"These crates are filled with heavy metal canisters. Judging from the care packing\n"
" them, you suspect that they contain some sort of hazardous chemicals."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/newrvb.msg:550
msgid "Now's probably not the best time to be striking up conversation."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:100
msgid "You see Myron! Myron, baby, Myron!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:150
msgid "You see a pasty-faced teenager leering at you. His hair is greasy, and he smells faintly of formaldehyde."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:151
msgid "You see Myron. He's scoping you out from the corner of his eye."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:200
msgid "You see a pasty-faced teenager. His hair is greasy, and he smells faintly of formaldehyde."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:201
msgid "You see Myron. He's looking around like a ferret."
