#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:861
msgctxt "myn125b"
msgid "By putting tons of brahmin shit in the vats, we found out that the fumes give more than enough of a kick. Eureka. Literally. 'Course, we had to test to get the mix right..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:862
msgid "Uh, how much testing?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:863
msgid "How much testing exactly?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:866
msgid "This sounds like a load of crap... literally. It doesn't sound like you know anything about drug manufacture. \"Brahmin Shit Fumes?\" Please. I've heard enough."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:870
msgctxt "myn126"
msgid "Hmmm... about a hundred slaves? Mostly heart attacks, cerebral hemorrhages, psychotic episodes... that sort of thing."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:871
msgid "Are you insane? You killed a hundred human beings just for drug testing?!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:872
msgid "Figures... Jet can be pretty powerful stuff. Least nobody important died. Still, hard to believe you killed that many, though..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:880
msgctxt "myn127"
msgid "Well, not on purpose. I mean, slaves are expensive. Still, we made the money back in the first few months, so the Mordino Family wasn't too pissed at me."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:881
msgid "I think you and I are going to get along, Myron. Ends justify the means. Say, I had some other questions..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:882
msgid "Myron, you are lower than a snake's shadow. Killing humans for drug testing... that's the coldest thing I've ever heard."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:883
msgid "Myron, you killed over a hundred humans beings for the sake of drug testing? Did you get your conscience lobotomized when you were a kid?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:884
msgid "Tell me about it. Slave prices keep going up. If humans only bred faster. Anyway, I had some other questions..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:885
msgid "I... see. Look, I had some other questions..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:886 dialog/vcnancy.msg:235
msgid "I think I've heard enough."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:887
msgid "Oh, well, THAT makes it all right, then. I've heard enough. I'm out of here."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:890
msgctxt "myn128"
msgid "You getting bent at me over a bunch of slaves? Hey, we had to make sure Jet wouldn't kill our customers."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:891
msgid "You have a point, Myron. I had some other questions..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:893
msgid "Oh, well, THAT makes it all right, then. Congratulations, Myron. You have hit the lowest common denominator possible for a human being. I'm out of here."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:894
msgid "Sounds sensible. Maybe we'll talk later."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:900
msgctxt "myn129a"
msgid "How quaint. A cure. Sure. You go cold turkey. Course, I made sure that was a reeeal difficult option with Jet."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:901
msgctxt "myn129b"
msgid "Beautiful, look. This is drug addiction, not an STD. Only cure is to go cold turkey, heh heh, and that's a reeeal difficult option with Jet."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:902
msgid "How did you create Jet?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:903
msgid "Myron, you're a pretty smart fella. Consider it a challenge. What would it take to make a cure for Jet?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:910
msgctxt "myn130"
msgid "Ah for fuck's sake, it can't be done, all right? It's a goddamn drug, not a bacterial infection."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:911
msgid "It's basically a highly addictive meta-amphetamine, right? Couldn't you use a nervous system suppressant to break the addiction?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:913
msgid "Nevermind, Myron. Forget I asked."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:920
msgctxt "myn131"
msgid "Nice try, no dice. Jet ain't blocked that easy. Once it's in your system, it ain't coming out."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:921
msgid "What about using some kind of endorphin blocker? That would repress the chemical and psychological addiction, wouldn't it?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:924 dialog/vcmclure.msg:208 dialog/vcwalace.msg:153
msgid "Nevermind then."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:930
msgctxt "myn132"
msgid "Kee-rist. That has got to be the dumbest... hmmmm..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:940
msgctxt "myn133"
msgid "Well... maybe it would work, but I'm pretty sure Jet would just chew right through that shit. Now wh-wh-why the hell are we even talking about this?! Wh-where would you get your hands on endorphin blockers anyway?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:941
msgid "You tell me, Myron. You're a bright guy."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:950
msgctxt "myn134"
msgid "Maybe Vault City. They have a pretty good medical warehouse. A lot of old pre-holocaust bases also used to stock them to prevent combat drug addiction."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:951
msgid "Why don't we try Vault City?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:952
msgid "Pre-holocaust bases? Where?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:954
msgid "All right. Maybe I can find some somewhere."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:960
msgctxt "myn135"
msgid "Ha! You'd have better luck convincing a radscorpion to part with its tail than get Vault City to give up anything."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:961
msgid "What about those pre-holocaust bases? Where are those?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:962
msgid "Yeah, maybe. Look, I had some other questions..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:963
msgid "No harm in trying."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:970
msgctxt "myn136"
msgid "Do I look like a cartographer? You want to scour the desert for them, you go right ahead."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:971
msgid "What about Vault City?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:973
msgid "Thanks for nothing, Myron."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:974
msgid "I just might do that."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:980
msgctxt "myn137"
msgid "Oooh... with a wit like that, you're sure to wise up and go for me, beautiful. You'll see."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:981
msgid "Whatever. How did you create Jet?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:983
msgid "Yeah, we'll see. Can you make me some Jet?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:985
msgid "Forget I asked anything, Myron."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:990
msgctxt "myn139"
msgid "Wha-a-a-are you fucking serious? Whoa, whoa, hey, hey... you keep me around, I'll do you a favor. Huh? Wh-Whadda ya say?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:991
msgid "Like what kind of favor?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:992
msgid "Forget favors. Now buzz off, you annoying pest."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:993
msgid "Forget favors. Now wait here, you annoying pest."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:994
msgid "Forget I said anything. You can stay."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1005
msgctxt "myn140"
msgid "Hoh! Oh, so-o-o what was that, like tribal humor? Yea, hardy-har-har. Pretty fucking funny."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1006
msgid "Yeah, we tribals are famous for it. Let's get going."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1010
msgctxt "myn141"
msgid "Okay! Okay! I'll wait here. Phew! You could show me a little more respect, you know. I am MYRON."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1020
msgctxt "myn142a"
msgid "I've heard of a secret building with lots of strange vegetation around it. If I'm with you, I can point it out on a map."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1021
msgctxt "myn142b"
msgid "Could be I know one of Mordino's little stashes in Golgotha outside of Reno. Lotsa chips. Lotsa drugs. Just gotta keep me around."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1022
msgctxt "myn142c"
msgid "I'll... I'll carry more of your stuff! No hassles when you ask me to make drugs! Just keep me around, okay?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1023
msgid "Okay. You can stay."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1026
msgid "Forget it, Myron. Wait here until I get back."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1035
msgctxt "myn143a"
msgid "\"Can I make drugs?\" I'm Myron. Whaddya need?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1036
msgctxt "myn143b"
msgid "Hey, can't get enough, huh? Whaddya need?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1037
msgid "An antidote for radscorpion venom."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1038
msgid "Some Jet."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1039
msgid "Some stimpaks."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1040 dialog/nhmyron.msg:1113
msgid "Can you make super stimpaks?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1041
msgid "Nothing. I had some other questions..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1050
msgctxt "myn145a"
msgid "Uhm, I'm gonna need some radscorpion venom sacs first. Ironic, in'it?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1051
msgctxt "myn145b"
msgid "Oh, well, I'd looove to, beautiful, but I need radscorpion tails. Oh, well."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1052
msgid "Can you make any other drugs?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1053
msgid "Forget it then. I had some questions..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1060
msgctxt "myn146a"
msgid "Hmmm, Shouldn't be too hard. How many bottles of antidote you want?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1061
msgctxt "myn146b"
msgid "Ah, for cryin' out loud. Ever think it might be easier to just stay away from the friggin' scorpions in the first place, genius? How many you want this time?!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1062
msgctxt "myn146c"
msgid "Anything for you, beautiful. He-ha! How many you want?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1063
msgid "Just one."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1065
msgid "Three's a charm."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1066
msgid "Make antidote out of all the tails that we have. They aren't good for much else."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1067
msgid "Forget it. Can you make any other drugs?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1068
msgid "None; I've changed my mind. I had some questions..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1081
msgctxt "myn147a"
msgid "Done. Here you go."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1082
msgctxt "myn147b"
msgid "There. That's it. No more of that shit, all right? Next time, go find some backwater medicine man to do it."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1083
msgctxt "myn147c"
msgid "Done. Here you go, beautiful."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1085
msgid "Thanks. Look, I had some questions..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1086
msgid "Thanks, Myron. You're a real sport."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1095
msgctxt "myn148"
msgid "Sorry, ain't got the \"raw materials\" I need... don't really wanna get 'em, either."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1097
msgid "Forget it then. I had some other questions..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1098
msgid "All right. Thanks a bunch, Myron."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1105
msgctxt "myn149a"
msgid "Piece of cake. How many packs you want?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1106
msgctxt "myn149b"
msgid "Hey, genius. Ever cross your mind that it might be easier just to stay outta trouble, huh? OK, how many?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1107
msgctxt "myn149c"
msgid "Just tell me how much and where you want it, beautiful."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1111 dialog/nhmyron.msg:1151
msgid "Make as many stimpaks as you can from what we're carrying."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1114
msgid "Forget it. I had some questions..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1125
msgctxt "myn151"
msgid "Sorry, we just ain't got what I need to whip up a stim. Let's see: You'll need some xander root... some broc flower... and an empty hypo."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1126
msgid "Can you make some other drugs?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1127
msgid "If you can make stimpaks, couldn't you make some super stimpaks?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1128
msgid "All right then. I had some questions..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1135
msgctxt "myn152"
msgid "Of course I could...'cept we ain't got what I need. Some of that mutated fruit for the citric acid... a splash a' Nuka-Cola... and a normal stimpak."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1145
msgctxt "myn153a"
msgid "Repeat after me: Myron's a genius. How many packs you want?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1146
msgctxt "myn153b"
msgid "How about. Stay. Out. Of. Trouble? Nevermind, obviously too tough a concept. How many this time?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1147
msgctxt "myn153c"
msgid "Myron's your man, beautiful. How many?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1149
msgid "Give me two."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1170
msgctxt "myn201a"
msgid "Who're you an' how the hell did you get in here? Wh-where are those jackass guards?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1171
msgctxt "myn201b"
msgid "Why, helll-ooooo there, beautiful. What can Myron do to, ah-uh, for you?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1172
msgid "Gud. Nuh-uh."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1173
msgid "Hell-oooooo Moron. Me "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1174
msgid "Gud. Ded."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1175
msgid "Weak people watching door stop breathing when I hurt them"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1176 dialog/vclynett.msg:142 dialog/vclynett.msg:386
msgid "Bye-bye"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1177
msgid "Your guards are too busy being dead to be watching the door."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1178
msgid "I used this badge. Marjorie sent me."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1180 dialog/nhmyron.msg:1198
msgid "You Myron?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1181
msgid "Easy there, tiger. Keep those hormones in check. Who are you?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1182
msgid "Easy there, tiger. Keep those hormones in check. You Myron?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1183
msgid "Sorry. I seem to have entered the wrong room."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1195
msgctxt "myn202"
msgid "So. Who are you? Spill it, or I'll have the guards BEAT it out of you."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1196
msgid "Your guards are too dead to do much of anything. Got any other questions, you little shit?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1199
msgid "I think I'll just go take a walk out of here. Nice meeting you."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1205
msgctxt "myn203"
msgid "Great. One of the mental midgets from upstairs. Look, I ain't got much here, but you can, tuh-tuh-take whatever you want."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1206
msgid "WAN YOU DED"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1207
msgid "Wan Ull. Now."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1208
msgid "Hoo yoo? Yoo FREN of "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1215
msgctxt "myn204"
msgid "Sure! You bet! Uh, here you go. Here's all of it. Now uh, you go back to your stall now, okay?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1216
msgid "Nuh-uh. Kill."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1217
msgid "Hoo yoo? Yoo FRIEND of "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1225
msgctxt "myn205"
msgid "Abso-fucking-lutely! Heh, you bet! You and I are gonna be the best of friends, okay?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1226
msgid "Lie? "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1227
msgid "Fren give ull "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1235
msgctxt "myn207"
msgid "Of course you are. Have a seat on the bed. Can I get you a drink, maybe a little... Jet?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1236
msgid "Sit. Drenk."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1237
msgid "Yoo fren?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1245
msgctxt "myn208"
msgid "Excellent... here you go. A little drink - help you re-lax, y'know what I mean?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1246
msgid "Drenk"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1247
msgid "Yoo "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1255
msgctxt "myn209"
msgid "Uh, hey, hey, hey! Wait a minute! Stay - have a drink first! We can talk, be friends. You DO want us to be friends, right?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1265
msgctxt "myn210"
msgid "I'm suuure we'll be friends."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1266
msgid "Wan fren."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1267
msgid "Fren. Giv ull. No owww."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1275
msgctxt "myn211"
msgid "Now, you just relax, sweetmeat..."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1276
msgid "Okeezzzzzzz Zznnzznn Zzznnnzzzz"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1285
msgctxt "myn212"
msgid "Hmmmm. You must have the constitution of a Brahmin. Get outta here, beautiful."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1295
msgctxt "myn213"
msgid "Guards ain't worth the chips you pay for 'em... well, my retarded friend, we've been introduced, so why don't you GET THE HELL OUTTA HERE NOW!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1296
msgid "OW EARS. KILL."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1297
msgid "Nuh fren?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1305
msgctxt "myn214a"
msgid "Yeah, you bet, pal. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1306
msgctxt "myn214b"
msgid "Yeah, you bet, honey. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1307
msgctxt "myn214c"
msgid "You and me - friends for ever n' ever. Or the next injection. NOW GET THE HELL OUTTA HERE!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1308
msgid "NUH FREN. KILL."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1309
msgid "Fren giv ull. No oww."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1325
msgctxt "myn215a"
msgid "God-DAMN it! I told Jesus those two morons couldn't guard a stone! So uh, you iced them, huh? Gonna kill me, too?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1326
msgctxt "myn215b"
msgid "Whoa. Hot and deadly! So you iced them, huh? You gonna kill me, too?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1327
msgid "I'm thinking about it. You got something to convince me otherwise... kid?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1328
msgid "Not unless you do something stupid. Who are you?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1329
msgid "Not unless you do something stupid. You Myron?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1330
msgid "Yeah, why not? I ain't killed anyone since I started this conversation. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1331
msgid "Not now. Maybe later. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1345
msgctxt "myn216a"
msgid "Sure, pal. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1346
msgctxt "myn216b"
msgid "Sure, lady. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1347
msgctxt "myn216c"
msgid "You bet, beautiful. "
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1348
msgctxt "myn216d"
msgid "I-I can give you drugs. You lookin' to fly?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1349
msgid "Actually, I want everything you have. Hand it over, and I'll let you live."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1350
msgid "Sure. Give me all the drugs you got."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1351
msgid "I don't want anything right now. Maybe later."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1365
msgctxt "myn217"
msgid "All right, all right. Here you go. Now will you leave me alone?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1366
msgid "No. Who are you?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1367
msgid "No. You Myron?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1368
msgid "Sure. For now... I may be back, though."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1375
msgctxt "myn218a"
msgid "M-maybe. W-who the hell are you?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1376
msgctxt "myn218b"
msgid "Say, you one of Mordino's new whores or just a big fan of Myron? Ooh, you got a name to go with those legs, beautiful?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1377
msgctxt "myn218c"
msgid "Who the hell are you?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1378
msgctxt "myn218d"
msgid "I'm someone who's been looking for someone like you, beautiful. And you are...?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1380
msgid "I'm just a traveler passing through."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1381
msgid "I'm someone who's in the wrong room. Later."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1395
msgctxt "myn219a"
msgid "That so? Why are you here? Huh? Thought you could hit Myron up for some free drugs?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1396
msgctxt "myn219b"
msgid "Whatever, beautiful. Want some drugs to break the ice, or should we just get down to some mattress dancing?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1397
msgid "I would, but I don't have ten seconds to spare right now. What drugs are you talking about?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1398
msgid "Drugs? Like what?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1399
msgid "I'm definitely in the wrong room. Pardon me."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1405
msgctxt "myn220a"
msgid "Hey stupid! Jet, mother fucker, Jet! Yer talkin' to its maker. Its creator. Its... God."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1406
msgctxt "myn220b"
msgid "Are you stupid? Jet, bitch, Jet! Yer talkin' to its maker. Its creator. Its... God."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1407
msgctxt "myn220c"
msgid "You ever heard of Jet, beautiful? Well, yer talkin' to its maker. Its creator. Its... God."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1408
msgid "Bullshit. You didn't make Jet."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1409
msgid "You made Jet?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1410
msgid "You made Jet? No way! That stuff is making a KILLING on the streets!"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1411
msgid "Big deal. I'm out of here."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1412
msgid "Your mother must be proud. Later, kid."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1413
msgid "Really? Interesting. I have to go now."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1425
msgctxt "myn221a"
msgid "I did so make Jet! What, you think this lab is for show?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1426
msgctxt "myn221b"
msgid "Sorry to prove you wrong, beautiful, but look around. This lab ain't just for show."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1427
msgid "All right. MAYBE you did make Jet."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1428
msgid "Why did you make Jet?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1430
msgid "Your mother must be proud. I'm out of here."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1445
msgctxt "myn222"
msgid "Damn right I did! I make the shit everybody wants and can't get enough of."
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1455
msgctxt "myn223"
msgid "\"Why?\" 'Cause I could. Family Mordino needed a product, Myron makes a product, Mordino makes Myron happy... at least as happy as they're able. Nice lil' circle o' love, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1456
msgid "How did you make Jet?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1457
msgid "'As happy as they're able?' Are you happy here?"
msgstr ""

#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:1458
msgid "How about I suggest a new circle to you? Mordino doesn't know talent when they see it - I do."
