"                                                         Power requirements: 3.98mkw/day\n"
"                                 Stores: Complete construction equipment, hydro-agricultural farms, water purification system from underground river,\n"
" defensive weaponry to equip 10 men, communication, social and entertainment files (for total duration)"
msgstr ""

