msgstr ""

#: game/editor.msg:1115
msgid "Let's be honest: You sleep with anything that walks on two legs. Sometimes, you're not even that discriminating."
msgstr ""

#: game/editor.msg:1116
msgid "\"They're dead, they don't care,\" has become your motto. Digging up the remains of others is more than a hobby for you."
msgstr ""

#: game/editor.msg:1117
msgid "You are a \"Made Man\" of the Salvatore Family. You are well-known, well-respected, and look great in a fedora."
msgstr ""

#: game/editor.msg:1118
msgid "You got hitched. Hey, it's your problem, not ours."
msgstr ""

#: game/editor.msg:1119
msgid "You are a big, bright, shining star. Your sexual exploits are well-known throughout New Reno."
msgstr ""

#: game/editor.msg:1120
msgid "You have been marked as a member of the Slaver's Guild. The tattoo on your forehead makes your profession evident to everyone you meet."
msgstr ""

#: game/editor.msg:1121
msgid "You really need to get out more. Your sexual exploits have been... well, two dimensional."
msgstr ""

#: game/editor.msg:1122
msgid "You are a \"Made Man\" of the Bishop Family. You are well-known, well-respected, and look great in a fedora."
msgstr ""

#: game/editor.msg:1123
