#: game/perk.msg:1101
msgid "With Awareness, you are given detailed information about any critter you examine. You see their exact hit points and information about any weapon they are equipped with."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1102
msgid "You have learned the secret arts of the East, or you just punch faster. In any case, your hand-to-hand and melee attacks cost 1 AP less to perform."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1103
msgid "Experience in unarmed combat has given you the edge when it comes to damage. You cause +2 points of damage with hand-to-hand and melee attacks for each level of this Perk."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1104
msgid "For each level of Bonus Move, you get 2 free APs each turn that can only be used for movement. In other words, you can move 2 free hexes each turn for each level of this Perk."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1105
msgid "Your training in firearms and other ranged weapons has made you more deadly in ranged combat. For each level of this Perk, you do +2 points of damage with ranged weapons."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1106
msgid "This Perk allows you to pull the trigger a little faster and still remain as accurate as before. Each ranged weapon attack costs 1 AP less to perform."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1107
msgid "You are more likely to move before your opponents in combat, since your Sequence is +2 for each level of this Perk."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1108
msgid "With each level of this Perk, you get a +2 bonus to your Healing Rate. This is in addition to your normal healing rate, thus you heal faster."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1109
msgid "You are more likely to cause critical hits in combat if you have this Perk. Each level of More Criticals gets you an additional +5% chance to cause a critical hit."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1110
msgid "With the Night Vision Perk, you can see in the dark better. This will reduce the overall darkness level by 20%."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1111
msgid "You command attention by just walking into a room. The initial reaction of another person is improved by 10% for each level of this Perk."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1112
msgid "You are better able to avoid radiation and the bad effects radiation causes. Each level of this Perk improves your Radiation Resistance by 15%."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1113
msgid "When you are tough, you take less damage. Each level of this Perk adds +10% to your general damage resistance."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1114
msgid "AKA Mule. You can carry an additional 50 pounds of equipment for each level of this Perk."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1115
msgid "You have a talent for hitting things at longer distances. For each level of this Perk, you get a +2 bonus to Perception for the purposes of determining range modifiers. It's easier than ever to kill at long range!"
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1116
msgid "With this Perk, you now have the ability to move quickly and still remain quiet. You can Sneak and run at the same time. Without this Perk, you would automatically stop Sneaking if you ran."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1117
msgid "You are a master of the outdoors. This Perk confers the ability to survive in hostile environments. You get a +25% bonus to Outdoorsman."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1118
msgid "You have mastered one aspect of bartering - buying goods far more cheaply than normal. With this Perk, you get a 25% discount when purchasing items from a store or another trader."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1119
msgid "Each level of Educated adds +2 skill points when you gain a new experience level. This Perk works best when purchased early in your adventure."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1120
msgid "The healing of bodies comes easier to you with this Perk. Each level of this Perk heals 4-10 additional hit points when using the First Aid or Doctor skills."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1121
msgid "You have the talent of finding money. You find additional money in random encounters in the desert."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1122
msgid "The critical hits you cause in combat are more devastating. You gain a 20% bonus on the critical hit table, almost ensuring that more damage will be done. This does not affect the chance to cause a critical hit."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1123
msgid "You have studied other human beings, giving you inside knowledge of their emotional reaction to you. You will see the reaction level of the person you are talking to when involved in an indepth conversation."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1124
msgid "The Slayer walks the earth! In hand-to-hand combat all of your hits are upgraded to critical hits, causing destruction and mayhem."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1125
msgid "You have mastered the firearm as a source of pain. With this Perk, any successful hit in combat with a ranged weapon will be upgraded to a critical hit if you also make a Luck roll."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1126
msgid "While Sneaking, if you hit a critter in the back, you will cause double damage using a hand-to-hand attack. Silent Death is that kind of Perk."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1127
msgid "Each level of Action Boy (insert Girl if you wish) gives you an additional AP to spend every combat turn. You can use these generic APs on any task."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1128
msgid "Mental Block is the ability to tune out any outside mental interference. You must have learned this talent from a passing guru, or from a really late night at a bar."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1129
msgid "With each level of this Perk, you gain an additional 4 Hit Points every time you advance a level. This is in addition to the hit points you already gain per level based off of your endurance."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1130
msgid "You are less likely to be hit in combat if you have this Perk. You gain a +5 to your Armor Class, in addition to the AC bonus from any armor worn."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1131
msgid "Yum! Tastes like chicken. For each level of this Perk, you gain +25% to your Poison Resistance."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1132
msgid "This Perk will give you a one-time bonus of +10% to the Repair and Science skills. A little late night cramming never hurt anybody, especially you."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1133
msgid "The Medic Perk gives you a one-time bonus of +10% to the First Aid and Doctor skills. Healing skills are a good thing."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1134
msgid "A Master Thief is proficient at stealing and picking locks. You gain +15 to Stealing and Lockpicking. Steal from the rich, and give to you."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1135
msgid "Being a Speaker means you have a one-time bonus of +20% to Speech. From the mouth of babes and all that."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1136
msgid "Each level of the Heave Ho! Perk gives you an additional +2 to Strength (up to 10,) for purposes of determining range with thrown weapons only. This Perk will not exceed a weapon's maximum range."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1137
msgid "ERROR.UNIMPED!"
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1138
msgid "You are much more adept at stealing than the normal crook. You can steal with the best of them, because with this Perk, you ignore size and facing modifiers when stealing from a person."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1139
msgid "When the sun goes down or you are in a poorly lit area, you move like a ghost with this Perk. Your Sneak skill is enhanced +20% in dark conditions."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1140
msgid "Your reputation is always positive to people. Without this Perk, a large negative reputation would have a bad effect on good natured people. This works in the reverse as well. Evil people will even treat Mr. Goodie Good as one of the gang."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1141
msgid "You can find more ammo than the normal post-holocaust survivor. This Perk doubles the amount of ammo found in random encounters."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1142
msgid "The mark of the Explorer is to search out new and interesting locations. With this Perk, you have a greater chance of finding special places and people."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1143
msgid "With this Perk, you are less likely to be addicted to chems (50% less likely, actually), and you suffer half the withdrawal time of a normal person."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1144
msgid "The Pathfinder is better able to find the shortest route. With this Perk, your travel time on the World Map is reduced by 25% for each level."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1145
msgid "Animals will not attack one of their friends, unless the animal is threatened or attacked first. Exactly what an animal is in this world is open to debate."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1146
msgid "You have improved your ability to see distant locations, increasing the size of explorations on the World Map by one square in each direction. You also have a better chance of finding special encounters."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1147
msgid "With this Perk, you have gained the attention of a Mysterious Stranger, who will appear to help you from time to time. If your ally is lost in combat, do not expect him (or her) to be replaced."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1148
msgid "You gain a +15% toward your Outdoorsman skill. You are more likely to avoid random encounters if you choose, and tend to find those \"special\" encounters more than most."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1149
msgid "You have learned to pack your equipment better. Accessing your inventory only costs you 2 Action Points in Combat instead of 4."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1150
msgid "You have learned to increase your dialog options without understanding what you're talking about. Each level of this Perk will increase your Intelligence by one, up to 10, for purposes of dialog only."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1151
msgid "You are indeed a Swift Learner with this Perk, as each level gives you an additional +5% bonus whenever you earn experience points. This is best taken early."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1152
msgid "Your skills have improved to the point where you can pick an additional Tag Skill. Tag skills increase twice as fast."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1153
msgid "The radiation of the wasteland has changed you! One of your Traits has mutated into something else..."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1154
msgid "You crave another Nuka-Cola."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1155
msgid "You've got the shakes."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1156
msgid "You feel groggy."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1157
msgid "You feel light-headed."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1158
msgid "You feel nauseous."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1171
msgid "Everything is moving so slowly... you need to get some more Jet, right NOW!"
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1172
msgid "You feel a burning desire to open another box of Tragic cards."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1174
msgid "You have the knowledge of how to skin geckos properly to get their hides."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1175
msgid "You have inherent protection against physical attacks."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1176
msgid "You have extra inherent protection against physical attacks."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1177
msgid "You have inherent protection against thermal attacks."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1178
msgid "You have extra inherent protection against thermal attacks."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1179
msgid "You have gained +10% resistance to both poison and radiation."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1180
msgid "With this Perk, you gain +1 to your Strength when you drop below 1/2 of your max hit points."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1181
msgid "You are more alert outdoors and enemies are less likely to sneak up on you. With this Perk you get a +3 to your perception in random encounters when determining placement."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1182
msgid "You pay much closer attention to the smaller details when reading. You gain 50% more skill points when reading books."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1183
msgid "You are an expert when it comes to the fine art of handling explosives. They always go off when they're supposed to, as well as causing extra damage."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1184
msgid "You can roll with the best of them.  You gain +20% to your gambling skill."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1185
msgid "With this Perk you gain +1 to your Strength."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1186
msgid "With this Perk you gain +1 to your Perception."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1187
msgid "With this Perk you gain +1 to your Endurance."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1188
msgid "With this Perk you gain +1 to your Charisma."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1189
msgid "With this Perk you gain +1 to your Intelligence."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1190
msgid "With this Perk you gain +1 to your Agility."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1191
msgid "With this Perk you gain +1 to your Luck."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1192
msgid "Your innocent demeanor makes stealing from people a little easier. You gain 20% to your Steal skill."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1193
msgid "With this Perk you immediately gain one experience level."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1194
msgid "If both item slots are empty, each unused action point gives you a +2 instead of +1 towards your armor class at the end of your turn, plus 1/12 of your unarmed skill."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1195
msgid "When it comes to pleasing sexually, you wrote the book."
msgstr ""

#: game/perk.msg:1196
msgid "Your Karma shines twice as bright. Whether good or bad, your Karma is doubled for any kind of reaction or modifiers."
msgstr ""

